<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">-Yemsa New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Marqos</para>
  <para style="toc1">Marqosni Misirachchuni Kaama</para>
  <para style="toc2">Marqos</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mar.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Marqos Tichina</para>
  <para style="mt2">Daamni Yesus Kiristoosni Misirachchuni Kaama</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gachgiru</para>
  <para style="ip">Marqosni misirachchuni kaamaas: «Han Ha'oosi naa Yesus Kiristoosni misirachchuni kaamaasi tesu» yittu makefe. Han misirachchuni kaamaassi Yesus wostoni asunawa ha'suni hugnaba faana asuna sinnetu ye. Ha'suni hugnabaas dey assubaasik; kiina ayyanaasta fa hugnabaasiknawa asuni boor'aason feeshun ubaasiknatu biiste. Yesus: «Asuni meyanon boor'aasi bozsusin birmadumma kisuk kaanaason furonir zagira imak ye asuni naawa» yiretu bar teetbaasik make.</para>
  <para style="ip">Marqos Yesusni tochooson besinaas zeephtonewa hugnak tuuma ugnak sinfaat zaggire makenaas dey Yesusni kaamaastanawa assustana sinnoynaron bar wostena diinqi wostoosongwa. Haphqife Yohannisni tochoosik dey; Yesusni haphuqtoosewa fattantoose asik kawuna gachgiru imnanneen orfo tichife bar Yesusni assusi chowanonnawa meroossin fatubaasi wostononnatu kotte makefe. Wonaneen orfo Yesusnik zoonustefe meya Yesusnin mai'sire arset hameteesne faaron Yesusnin tugga'sefe baasso dey arkissire oomteset hamete. Koi'ni eddeesikito Yesusni kaasta koi'ni torbaniissi zagte wuzasikitonon; arkiron dey basa suuttosewa basa kitun kabuuse asintu makefa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Misirachchuni kaamaasi koi'ta kuni hep bagtoosikito isa isa tichaasikitosi koi'batu fa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Tichaas sir ephna ephobaas</para>
  <para style="io1">Misirachchuni kaamaasi tesu <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 1:1-13">1:1-13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesus basa wostooson Galiilak wostobaas <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 1:14-9:50">1:14—9:50</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yerusalem hamme wostobaas <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 10:1-52">10:1-52</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yerusalemuknawa biratoostana fa ke'eessi koi'ni torbaniis <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 11:1-15:47">11:1—15:47</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesusni kitun kabu <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">16:1-8</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kitun kabi Daamiisa ammanon bestonewa den sama hamne <char style="ior"><ref loc="MRK 16:9-20">16:9-20</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Haphqife Yohannisni Misirachchuni Maamni Mako</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat. 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luqa. 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoha. 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>Haniis Ha'oni Naa <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ha'oni naa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha'oni naa yifa bar isa isa matsafaassi aafa</char></note> sina Yesus Kiristoosni chowaason makefa misirachchuni kaamni tesu. <verse eid="MRK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/>Raajju sina Isayyasni matsafaassi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">«Ugunneeson sabsuni wositarin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">ne sinaasta zeemma wosuna;<verse eid="MRK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>Dey:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">« ‹Daamiisa ugnanon hoossuti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">sabsira mai'suti› yit;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">zaboossi chaagfe asuni kaama.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 1:3">yistera tichche.<verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>Es bari boor'a haphqife Yohannis ichma daassi: «Boor'nitiis feeshun ustonak harmira haphuqtoti» yit maket ye. <verse eid="MRK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>Yuudani daastannawa Yerusalemni katamaassinna zuuttere akam showo asuni meya Yohannisniki yeesere boor'besiison harmifaafe Yordanosni akaassi barik haphukteset feeseter.<verse eid="MRK 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>Haphqife Yohannisni maamaas gaalani esak wichonontu mayfe. Geshobaason dey talfaktu taar'efe. Muubaas bilnganewa zaboni eesne. <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>Asuni meyak: «Ta mugira chaa'mabaasi taar'anon kotak sholsunoynar tayistan akamanon ulfinto ta orfoosta yoonir. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>Ta nittotin akaktu haphquna. Sinuntano bar Korto Ayyanaktu nittotin haphquna» yit maket feer.<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Haphuqtonewa fattantone</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat. 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luqa. 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>Es kabaasik Yesus Galiilaki daasta fa katama Naaziretun yeere Yordanoski akaassi Yohannisnik haphukte. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>Geregere Yesus akaassin kesfena kabaasik samaas gachchefennawa Ha'oni Ayyana nakalonimato sinna basaasta kerefeenna bi. <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/>Es kabaasik: «Shunfanana naata newa. Neektu ta girefawungwa» yifa kaama den saman odte.<verse eid="MRK 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Geregere Korto Ayyana barin ichma daassi taami. <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>Ichma daassi Sexanak fattantet acheechasir wona di. Buur'uni Gonyoneentu fe. Ha'oni wosiya dey barin argasse.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tesuni Nawoni Meeni Korto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:14-17">Mat. 4:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luqa. 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>Yohannis taatoni keer girinanneen orfo Yesus Ha'oosi misirachchuni kaamanon maket Galiila hami. <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/>Assifena kabaasik dey: «Wonaas ko'i, Ha'oosi taatoni ha'su tai'se. Boor'nitiison harmira misirachchuni kaamaasik amanoti» iyaafe maket feer.<verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Yesus Galiilaki baarisi tesha kamo aatfet wostobesi qurxummini esha sinna Simonnawa ayba Indiriyasna yugudobesiison akaassi ha'sefeen bi. <verse eid="MRK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Yesus dey baassok: «Taneen ane yootiwa. Eekaat Ha'oosi taatosi asunin zuututik zagunawa» yi. <verse eid="MRK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>Baasso dey geregere yugudobesiison beyfaat barneen ane hamete.<verse eid="MRK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>Estan garonon eksefena kabaasik Zabdiyosni naanggot Yaqobnawa ayba Yohannisna feeseter. Baasso goonuusta diisefaat yugudobesiison ma'issefeen bi. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>Estan geregere hang barki yoosonek teege. Baasso dey ababesi Zabdiyosnin wostinynyasakitoneen goonuusta beyye ha'aat barneen ane hamete.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kiina Ayyanaason Kisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luqa. 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>Yesusnawa nawobaasakitona Kifirnahom katama hamete. Geregere Yesus beysani wonaasik Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi girire assu ephi. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/>Yesus Museni tumaasi assinynyani meya assisefemato sinnoynaron daason ha'sife baassomato sinna boor'a assifena assusik diinqesete.<verse eid="MRK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>Es kabaasik Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi kiina ayyana ephna isa asu ekka yit chaagi: <verse eid="MRK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>«Naaziretki Yesusno! Inno neneen awuni isarni faarinso? Innotin tishkutak yaataroso? Oo sintamato ta arifawungwa. Ne Ha'oosi Kortowa!»<verse eid="MRK 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Yesus dey: «Isa kaama kotnoy basaassin kes!» yit chinire ke'i.<verse eid="MRK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>Kiina ayyanaas asusin gansira tookonak zagira akama kaamak chaagga basaassin kesi. <verse eid="MRK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>Asuni meya zuuttere diinqok: «Han bar aambanso? Aroni gaddo assunso? Kiina ayyanaason ha'suni hugnak ajajen bar dey ajajamer» yit baassotna baassotna mamsit feeseter.<verse eid="MRK 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Geregere Yesusni chowaasi wolla Galiilani biratoosta fa daa zuuttambaase asiissi zi'i.<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Showo Mettanni Meyanon Fati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat. 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luqa. 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>Es kabaasik Yesus Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassin kesse Yaqobneen Yohannisneen ane Simonnawa Andriyasna asi keer giri. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>Estak Simonni asusi into gumtanni mero mettera kunir. Bari mettooson geregere Yesusnik maksete. <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>Yesus barki tai'sere kushubaassi zatte kabgi. Meroos dey ma'in kabira baassotin irbasi.<verse eid="MRK 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Awa girin talmefana kabaasik asuni meya mettanni meyanonnawa kiina ayyana ephna meyanonna zuutire Yesusniki ephphe yeesete. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>Katamaassi fe asuni meya zuuttambesiise keyaasi fochata zuuttere feeseter. <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>Yesus showo tesa merok mettere fe showo asunin fati. Showo kiina ayyanaason dey kisi. Kiina ayyanaasnu bar oo sinnamato arsera faaser sinna boor'a Yesus isa wuzane maksonak aane sholowe.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Shaato Dimta Hamme Shiiphe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luqa. 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Wonsa wassi kabire wonnoyfeen Yesus keerun kesse isa fuchcha dima hamme Ha'o shiiphe. <verse eid="MRK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Simonnawa barneen ane feese baassotna sholok kabi hamete. <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>Danere: «Asu zuuttere neen sholediferwa» yisete.<verse eid="MRK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>Yesus wolgire: «Ta yaanaas esiisik sinna boor'a hantan ooma tai'so dimaasta faase katamaassi dey hamfaani kaambaason makongwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi kaambaason maket kiina ayyanaason asusasin kisit Galiilani daa zuuttambaase asiissi kutit feer.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Awataatoni Mettaniisin Fati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat. 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-17">Luqa. 5:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Isa awataatoni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:40 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Awataatoni: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Girikni matsafaastak awataatoni mero yifa bar atuta kesfa mero zuuttambaase asintu besifa.</char></note> mettan barki yeere kaa'nefaat: «Ne shunfaatane fatuk chimatawa» yit shiiphe.<verse eid="MRK 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Yesus barik kenashtefaat kushubaason shongere atubaason taptifaat: «Shunfaungwa, kayimma» yi. <verse eid="MRK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Asus geregere merobaassin fari. <verse eid="MRK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>Yesus asusin mai'sire kiitire gafkaat: <verse eid="MRK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/>«Han baron ooknu makonoytamato aruwa. Sinuntano hamma teetneeson maagisik besu. Baassok zaala sinanak faruneesik Museni tumaas makena maa'aason imma» yi.<verse eid="MRK 1:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>Sinuntano asus estan kesnaase sina chowaason asu zuuttambaase asik wollok kabi. Es bari boor'a Yesus ammanon kesse aaffa katamaassinu girunak aane chime. Baak gerakalo asu foonto dima hamme di. Asuni meya dey daa daassin barki yeeset feeseter.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Laafa Asunin Fati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat. 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luqa. 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Garo wonaneen orfo Yesus Kifirnahom katama wolle yeere keer feenamato odte. <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>Keyaassi tuumme focharaas tiir'onanneen showo asu zuutte. Yesus dey baassok kaambaason assittu fe. <verse eid="MRK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>Acheech asu isa laafa asuni wor'e Yesusniki yeesete. <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>Dara showena boor'a Yesusniki tai'suk aane chimoto. Bar feena dimaastaki keyaasi aafanon kabgaat oppobaase yeet keer gedete. <verse eid="MRK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Yesus baasso amantooson biyaat laafa asusin: «Naa! Boor'nees feeshun yistewa» yi. <figure style="fig" alt="Single story flat-roofed house" file="LB00234B.tif" size="span" ref="2:4">Ayhudni meena keya </figure><verse eid="MRK 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Esta diise Museni tumaasi assinynyaasasin isa isaas nibbesiissi: <verse eid="MRK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>«Han asus awuni boor'a effatena mei'ni kaama makefeso? Isa Ha'oneen ooma boor'aason feeshun uuk chimnir oonso?» yisete.<verse eid="MRK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>Geregere Yesus nibbesiisi safaranon ayyanabaasik arifaat ekka yi: «Nibnitiissi awuniron ekka safaredifetirinso? <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/>Laafaasin: ‹Boor'nees feeshun yistewa› usingwa ‹Kabira opponeeson wor'a hamma› uusinso kashoyi? <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/>Sinuntano Asuni Naa daastak boor'aason feeshun uuk ha'suni hugnaba foobaason aruti» iyaat laafaasin: <verse eid="MRK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/>«Neek makefawungwa: Kabira opponeeson wor'a keene hamma!» yi.<verse eid="MRK 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Geregere kabire oppobaason wor'e asu zuuttambaase asi sina kesse hami. Es bari boor'a asuni meya zuuttere diinqeset: «Effatena wuza biira aane aruweni!» yit Ha'ooson galattesete.<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lewini Teegto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat. 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luqa. 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>Yesus hepsa wolle Galiilaki baarisi tesha hami. Showo dara dey zuuttesere barki yeeseten assi. <verse eid="MRK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>Esta kamo aatfeen girbo zuuttefanaasta di Alfiyosni naa Lewinin biyaat: «Taneen ane hamniwa» yi. Bar dey kabire barneen ane hami.<verse eid="MRK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Esseen orfo Yesus Lewini keer muu meefen showo asuni meya dey ane feeseter. Baassossin showo boor'ni meenawa girbo zuutife<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Girbo zuutife asu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Girbo zuutife asu Ayhudni meyaki aane shuntefe.</char></note> baassona Yesusnawa basa nawoni meena ane muu meesedifer. <verse eid="MRK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Ferisawini meeni keen sina tumaasi assinynyani meya Yesus girbo zuutife baassonawa boor'ni meena ane meefen biyefaat: «Girbo zuutife baassonawa boor'ni meena awuniron ane meere ushdiferinso?» yit nawoni meyanon mamussete.<verse eid="MRK 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Yesus es baron odefaat: «Mettanteno fayyanik etni asu aane sholsifewa. Ta yaanay boor'ni meyanon Ha'ooski wolguktano ookoni meyaktawa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Soomere Shiiphoni Chowuni Mamsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat. 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luqa. 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>Yohannisni nawoosnawa Ferisawini meena soomere shiiphseter. Isa isa asuni meya Yesusniki yeesere: «Yohannisni nawoosakitonawa Ferisawini meeni nawoosnakitona soomere shiiphseter. Ne nawoni meya soomere shiiphso beyefees awuni boor'anso?» yisete.<verse eid="MRK 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Yesus dey baassok wolgire: «Mariis baassoneen ane feen mozgituni meya soomere shiiphsonek sholsifawoso? Indaanewa! Mariis baassoneen ane feen soomere shiiphsonek aane sholsifawa. <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/>Sinuntano mariis baassostan oor kesana wona yoona. Es kabaasik soomere shiiphsone.<verse eid="MRK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>«Kur'u maamaasta gaddo erbe kunsire zoorifer aafe. Es baro zagaanane gaddo erbees kur'u mayaason karasir. Karatobaas dey zeemmati baristan akamatu sinana. <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/>Esiisimato kur'u ha'matoossi ora wayinini usha gedfer aafewa. Gedfaanane wayinini ushaas ha'matooson karasirwa. Waynini ushaas wuukter ha'matoos dey mangirwa. Es bari boor'a ora wayinini ushaasik gaddo ha'matotu sholsifarwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Beysani Wonaasi Daam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat. 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luqa. 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>Beysani wonasik Yesus foshaasta kamo aatfeen nawoni meya ane hamefet bona zago buggisete. <verse eid="MRK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Ferisawini meya: «Ne nawoni meya beysani wonaasik zagtonak sholsunoyson awuniron zagsefeso?» yit mamussete.<verse eid="MRK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>Yesus dey wolgire: «Dawitnawa barneen ane feese asusneen maktefena kabaasik awu zaginamato aane feretuwetinoso <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/>Abiyatar maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynya sinne feena neyaasik Ha'oosi keer girire maagni meyaktano oonu muunak sholsunoy tushaason me. Estan barneen ane feese baassok dey imi» yi.<verse eid="MRK 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>Dey Yesus: «Beysani wona asuniktu testetano asu beysani wonnir sinne aane testowewa. <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/>Es bari boor'a Asuni Naa beysani wonaasiknu daambaywa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kushuba Laafa Asusin Fati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat. 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luqa. 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>Dey Yesus wolle Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi giri. Estak dey kushuba laafa asu feer. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>Isa isa meya malatok chowa sholsefaat: «Han beysani wonaasik fatunitto biyaniwa» yire oodet feeseter. <verse eid="MRK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>Yesus dey kushuba laafa asusin: «Kabira hang ganeya yaara yerowa» yi. <verse eid="MRK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Estan asuni meyak: «Beysani wonaasik ma'aron zagungwa wedey mangunon zagunso; kaani fatungwa wedey worun; aaffarinso faqadteri makebbetiso?» yire mamsi. Sinuntano baasso shaakisete. <verse eid="MRK 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Yesus nibbesiisi chimak haarefaat biratoosta feese asuni meyanon gi'ak biyaat asusin: «Kushuneeson zeephwa» yi. Bar dey zeephin kushubaas fari. <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Estan Ferisawini meya geregere kesere Yesusnin aakkak worsonemato Herodisni keena sine baassoneen ane merkesete.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Showo Asuni Meya Yesusneen Ane Hamete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7"/>Yesus nawobaasneen ane Galiilani baariiski hami. Galiilani daastan yeese showo asuni meya orfobaase hamete. <verse eid="MRK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8"/>Bar zagit feena wuzason zuutire odesefaat Yuudani daastan, Yerusalemni katamaassin, Edomiyasni daastan, Yordanosni akaasi yesalo fa daastan, Tirosuknawa Sidonunna asi katamaassi biratotan Yesusniki yeesete. <verse eid="MRK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/>Daraasa showotan kabi chowa asuni meya tugsiset feeseter sinna boor'a goonu barik hoossusonek nawoni meyanon ajaje. <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>Showo asunin fatir sinna boor'a merobesi faana baasso zuuttere barin ta'ire farsonek tiir'siset feeseter. <verse eid="MRK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/>Asusasi fa kiina ayyana Yesusnin biyenaase sinba gandera: «Ne Ha'oni naawa» yit chaaget faaser. <verse eid="MRK 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Kiina ayyanaasikitonon dey bar oo sinnamato maksonoynamato zaggire ajaje.<verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asire Heppe Wosini Meeni Korto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat. 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luqa. 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Yesus aamaasta kesfaat bar shunna basakitonin teege. Basakito dey barki yeese. <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14-15"/>Barneen ane foosonek; kaambaason maksonek wosunak; kiina ayyanaasikitonon asusasin kisusonek ha'suni hugnabesi foonak asire heppe asunin koraat: «Wosi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14-15 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Wosi yire teegere: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wosi yire teegere yifa bar zeemoti Girikni tichaassi aafa.</char></note>» yire teege.<verse eid="MRK 3:14-15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>Es kortese asire heppe asusakito «Phexiros» yire sunsina Simon <verse eid="MRK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>«Boanerges» uus dey «Dedoni naanggot» yire sunsina Zabdiyosni naanggot Yaqobnawa Yohannisna, <verse eid="MRK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>Andriyas, Filiphoos, Bertelemewos, Maatiwos, Tomas, Ilfiyosni naa Yaqob, Tadewos, koonefe baassokin ye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Koonefe baassokin ye: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Koonefe baassokin ye yifa bar Ayhudni meyaassin birmadumma kesonek kabsesefe baasso keenaassin yeer sinbaasontu besifa.</char></note> Simon, <verse eid="MRK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>Yesusnin aatire ima Askorotki Yuuda.<verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusnawa Beelzebulna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mat. 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:4-23">Luqa. 11:4-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Esseen orfo Yesus keer ye. Barneen nawoni meyaneen showo asuni meya hepsa dey zuuttesete boor'a muuni muuk aane chimoto. <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>«Yesus nifasewa» yistefa wolla odesefaat koonni meya ephak yeesete.<verse eid="MRK 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>Yerusalemun yeese Museni tumaasi assinynyani meya: «Yesus Beelzebul basaassi faarwa! Kiina ayyanaasikitonon kisifenaas baron ha'sifa barikwa» yit wolumsete.<verse eid="MRK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>Yesus baassotin barki teegere besok ekka yi: «Sexanaas aakkak Sexanaason kisuk chimnirinso? <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/>Isa taatoos bare bare oor oor kesfaanane taatobaas zagira yerok aafa chimanawuza. <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/>Esiisimato isa keer fe asu oor oor kesfaanane zagire fook aafa chimanawuza. <verse eid="MRK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/>Es bari boor'a Sexanaas bare bare oor oor kesfaanane tishutu tishunatano aafa zagira yerona wuza.<verse eid="MRK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/>«Isa zag asuni keer girire zeemme es zag asusin ephphe taar'noy keebaassi fa foobaason bo'ok chimnir aafe. Taar'naneen orfotu bo'ok chimana.<verse eid="MRK 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/>«Futo makefawungwa, asuni meya wostesefe boor'aasewa maksefe me'aase zuuttera feeshun ustona. <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/>Sinuntano Korto Ayyanaasta mei'ni kaama maksefe baasso boor'aas koi'ba foonto kowatu sinanatano boor'besiis isanne aafa feeshun ustona wuza.<verse eid="MRK 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>« ‹Kiina ayyana basaassi faarwa› » yiset feeseter sinna boor'atu Yesus es baron make.<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Intoosewa Ayni Meena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat. 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luqa. 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Yesusni intoosewa aybaasakitona yeesere gerakalo yersefaat barki wosisere teegsisete. <verse eid="MRK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>Es biratoosta diise asuni meya: «Ne intoosewa ayneesakitona gerok neen sholsediferwa» yire maksete.<verse eid="MRK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>Yesus wolgire: «Intona oonso? Aytaasakito oona oonanso?» yit wolgi. <verse eid="MRK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>Biratoosta diise baassoki biifet: «Ese intonaasewa aytaasakitona haniiswa: <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/>Ha'oosi fiqadinon zagsefe baasso zuuttere ayta, eetna, intonawa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Zalni Bukinynyaasa Beso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat. 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luqa. 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>Hepsa wolle Yesus baarisi tesha daraasin assuk kabi. Akam showo asu barki esta yeesere zuuttesete boor'a Yesus goonuussi girire baariista di. Daraas zuuttere baarisi tesha feeseter. <verse eid="MRK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>Besok showo wuza baassok assi. Assifena kabaasik dey ekka yi: <verse eid="MRK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/>«Odotiwa! Bukinynyaas meeni bukak kesi. <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/>Bukfena kabaasik isa isaas ugnaasi ha'ta kere wor'i. Kasaas dey kephpha maase. <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/>Oomaas dey garo ho'ba faana kaa'oosta kere wor'i. Akama ho'a aafa sinna boor'a geregere kayi <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/>Sinuntano awa kesfana kabaasik aliqi. Tasbaas aane zaguwa sinna boor'a ichimi. <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/>Ooma zalaas dey seer'a faana daasta kere wor'i. Seer'aas kessa geer'na boor'a aane gaana. <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/>Oomaas ma'a buloosta kere wor'a bar kayira dichcha gaana gaani. Isaas keezasiron, isaas issunasiron, isaas tiyanon gaani.»<verse eid="MRK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>Estan dey Yesus: «Odoni odoba feenay odowowa!» yi.<verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Yesusni tesha feese asuni meenawa asire heppe nawobaasakitona Yesus bar bar sinfena kabaasik: «Besok maketa chowaasi kota aambanso?» yire mamussete. <verse eid="MRK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11"/>Bar dey wolgire: «Nittok Ha'oosi taatoni aacho chowni aruus imte. Sinuntano nittoneen foonto oomni meyak zuuttambaase besoktu maktefawa. <verse eid="MRK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12"/>Es bar dey:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">« ‹Baasso Ha'ooski wolseten boor'besiis feeshun ustonoynamato;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">aafbesiisik biifet aane yaadatesefe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">odobesiisik odefet aane gasasisefewa› »</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 4:12">yistenaasimatowa.<verse eid="MRK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>Dey Yesus baassok ekka yi: «Han besoson nitto aane aruwetinoso? Eekan ooma besosikitonon zuutira aakkak aruk chimfetiso? <verse eid="MRK 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/>Bukinynyaas kaambaasontu bukfe. <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/>Kaambaason buktefana kabaasik ugnaasi ha'ta kere wor'a bar kaambaason odesefe kabaasik geregere Sexana yaara es kaamaason nibbesiissin ephpha tishkifana asuni meyawa. <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/>Esiisimato dey kaa'oosta bukte bar kaambaason odesefe kabaasik geregere girak ephpheteesefe baassowa. <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/>Sinuntano es kabaasiktano baassossi kaambaasi tasa aane zaguwa. Garo wonaneen orfo kaambaasi boor'a isa rakko wedey kabugto yaafana kabaasik geregere tuusa'sere gandesefe. <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/>Seer'a faana daasta bukte bar dey kaambaason odefe baassotingwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/>Sinuntano han daastaki fooni chowaasi safara otumni keeshtanaasewa ooma ooma wuzni eenanto baasso nibaassi girira geer'fana boor'a gaana foonto fu'tesefe. <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/>Ma'a ho'aasta bukte bar dey kaambaason odere ephpheteesefe asuni meyawa. Es baasso isaas keezasiron, isaas issunasiron, isaas tiyanon gaanefe.»<verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tega Dimta Di Tonaasi Beso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luqa. 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>Tusire dey: «Isa asu tona tonire waashshi wedey kuphoni sikalosi duusifewoso? Tega dimtatanoso duusifenari? <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/>Es bari boor'a aachera ammanon kesnor uktera chaarefaasta kesnoy wuza aafawa. <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/>Ese odoni odoba feena bar odowowa.»<verse eid="MRK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>Dey Yesus ekka yi: «Han chowaasikitonon gasasira odotiwa! Nitto safarefeti safareesik wolla nittok safartera imtona. Es baristannu nittoosta dayister. <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/>Feena barik dayistera imter. Sinuntano tishfaanane es barik fa barnu ootter.»<verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dichfa Zalni Beso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>Dey Yesus tusire ekka yi: «Ha'oosi taato buloostaki zala bukfe asune faar. <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/>Asus waalin kunfe wonnanneen dey kabife. Aakkak sindifanamato arunoyfeen zalaas kayifa; dey dichfa. <verse eid="MRK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/>Buloos dey teetbak zeemma kaygifa. Estan ke'oba kisifa. Fotira gaana gaanfa. <verse eid="MRK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/>Meyaas katta kar'ni wona kar'nanneen asus magadak kar'a ephfe.»<verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fi'fi'oni Zalaasi Beso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-34">Mat. 13:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luqa. 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>Ekka dey yi: «Ha'oosi taatonon awuneen hoossunirinso? Aro besok dey hoossira makonirinso? <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/>Fi'fi'oni gaanane faarwa; bar dey buloosta buktefana kabaasik daasta fa zala zuuttambaase asiistan aterwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/>Sinuntano buktera kayinanneen orfo gooru buktera kayi zala zuuttambaase asiistan arkir sinfa. Samaastaki kasaas waay'baassi keeba keer'a duunanneen inya inya waay'a kisifa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Yesus asuni meya gasasire odok chimoneesne faaron effa showo besok kaambaason baassok maket feer. <verse eid="MRK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>Bar assifena kabaasik beso foonto aane assuwe. Sinuntano baasso baasso sinefe kabaasik chowaason zuutire nawoni meyak kotte maket feer.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Sirus Shaakkunak Zagi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat. 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luqa. 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>Es wono waalin Yesus nawoni meyak: «Han baarisi yesalo finaniwa» yi. <verse eid="MRK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Daraasin estak beyfaat Yesus diina goonuussi girire barin ephphe hamete. Ooma goonuusikito dey barneen ane faaser. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Akama akani guuboosi ipuwa kabira akaas goonuussi tuumananneen ipuwaas goonuuson ichet faar. <verse eid="MRK 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>Es kabaasik Yesus goonuusi orfosi bokta boktere kunfer. Nawoni meya barin guzgisere: «Assinynyano! Inno tishuus neen aane tiir'efanoso?» yisete.<verse eid="MRK 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>Bar guzire ipuwaason ke'i. Baariison dey: «Beyya shaakku!» yi. Ipuwaas dey siru beyi. Akama naganu sini. <verse eid="MRK 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>Yesus nawoni meyanon: «Awuniron ekka digedifetirinso? Hashneen amantonti aafanoso?» yi.<verse eid="MRK 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Akamanon digesere baassotna baassotna: «Eekan ipuwaasewa baariise ajajamenar han bar oonso?» yisesete.<verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Isa Kiina Ayyana Ephna Asunin Fati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat. 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luqa. 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>Galiilani baariison goonuk finere yesalo Gergesenonki daasta kar'ete. <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>Yesus goonuussin kerobaase geregere kiina ayyana ephna asu shu'ni moogaassin kesse barik uphe. <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>Es asus dey moogni dimsitu feefe. Oonu barin bittani shashsharaknu taar'e duusuk aane chimfe. <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>Showo wona wochoni bittaknawa shashsharakna taatet feer. Sinuntano Shashsharaason buggitnawa bittaason kiir'etna feer. Barin merok oonu chimfer aafe. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>Wonna wonna toonawa waalinna shu'ni moogaastanawa kumaastana kutifaafe chaaget feer. Atubaason shu'ak buu'e mazasit feer.<verse eid="MRK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>Kiina ayyanaas woksok Yesusni biinayse eella sinba kaa'nefaat. <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>Tega kaamak: «Akamanon ulfinto Ha'oosi naa Yesusno! Taneen awune faarinso? Taan kiichunoytamato Ha'oosi sunak tewuwa!» yit chaagi. <verse eid="MRK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>Es baron yinaas Yesus: «Ne kiina ayyana han asusasin kes» yina boor'a.<verse eid="MRK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Yesus dey: «Sunne oonso?» yire mamsi. Asus wolgire: «Inno showo sinni boor'a sunna Legewon»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Legewon uus 4,000 hamma 6,000 sinni meya taar'oni zuutto</char></note> yi.<verse eid="MRK 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>Barikitonon daastan kalle kofkunoynamato chinire Yesusni shiiphe.<verse eid="MRK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>Es daasta fa kumaasi tesha showo mukoni wodo keemtedifar. <verse eid="MRK 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>«Hamma mukoossi girunik innotin gafkuwa» yit shiiphse. <verse eid="MRK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Yesus dey hamma girunak maken kiina ayyanaasikito kessa mukoosikitosi giri. Hep kuma sinni muko kumaastan eelera baariissi girira kiti.<verse eid="MRK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Mukooson keemfe kezzoosakito eelere hamme katamaassinawa ke'eessina sina chowaason maksete. Asuni meya dey sina baron biyak kesete. <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>Yesusniki yeeseten es showo kiina ayyanaas ephna asus nibbaas wolin maya mayye diifen biyeteese digsete. <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Es kiina ayyanaas ephna asusa chowanonnawa mukoosikitotana sina baron zuutire zeemme biya asuni meya es yeese baassok maksete.<verse eid="MRK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>Es kabaasik es daasta fe asuni meya Yesus daabesiistan kesse hamanak shiiphsete.<verse eid="MRK 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Yesus goonuussi girifena kabaasik kiina ayyanaas basaassin kesna asus: «Neneen ane hamanawa» yit shiiphe. <verse eid="MRK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>Sinuntano Yesus aane ma'i uwe. Asusik wolgire: «Keene wolla hamfaat keerki asuni meyak Daamiis neek awune fa akama wuza zaginamatonawa aakkak neek kenashtenamatona makowa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Asus dey Yesus barik zagina chowaason: «Asir katama» yistefa daasta hamme awasi. Ode baasso zuuttere diinqeset feeseter.<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiti Nawaasewa Mettana Asuse</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat. 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luqa. 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Yesus dey goonuk yesalo hepsa wolle finfena kabaasik showo asu baarisi tesha barki esta zuuttere feeseter. <verse eid="MRK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaasi gaanynyaasasin Yayiros yiste isa asu yeere Yesusnin biinayse wochobaassi kaa'nere: <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>«Ate naanaas akamanon mettera kituna agaat kunirwa. Farira kaak foonak yaara kushuneeson barista ta'uwa» yire chinire shiiphe.<verse eid="MRK 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Yesus dey barneen ane hami. Showo asu orfobaase tiir'sisedifer.<verse eid="MRK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Asire heppe neya harinba wuuktet faana isa asu faar. <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>Showo etni asuniki hamfaafa akamanon rakkatet waagbaason dey koi'sit faar. Sinuntano merobaas arkittu hamitano faruk aane chima. <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>Bar Yesusni chowaason odera faar sinna boor'a asusa ganesi orfo kamo yaara maambaason ta'i. <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>Es baron zaginaas: «Maambaasta ta'ifaanane farunawa» yira faar.<verse eid="MRK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>Es wuuktet fa harinbaas geregere yere. Merobaassin farinamato atubaastak ari. <verse eid="MRK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Yesus dey geregere basaassin hugna kesnamato araat daraasa ganesi yerqere «Maamnaasta ta'is oonso?» yi.<verse eid="MRK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>Nawoni meya wolgire: «Daraas tiir'sisefeen biifat: ‹Oonso taan ta'iri› yifatoso?» yisete.<verse eid="MRK 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>Sinuntano Yesus es baron zagiis oo sinnamato aruk yerqere bi. <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>Estan asus barik zagte baron arina boor'a digera korkit yaara sinba kaa'nera futooson zuutira make. <verse eid="MRK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Bar dey: «Naanaase! Amantonees neen fatiwe. Maar'on hamme; meroneessin faruwe» yi.<verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>Yesus es baron makefena kabaasik Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaasi gaanynya Yayirosni keerun yeese asuni meya barik: «Naanees kitiwa. Hash awuniron assinynyaasin hopsifasso?» yisete.<verse eid="MRK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Sinuntano Yesus es baron odefet Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaasi gaanynyanin: «Amanotano digotaatawa» yi. <verse eid="MRK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>Yesus dey Phexirosneen, Yaqobneen, Yaqobni ay Yohannisneentano oom asu barneen ane hamanak aane ma'i uwe. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaasi gaanynyaasa keer yeere kar'fena kabaasik asuni meya sasetnawa waasitna chaaga aatamsisefeen bi. <verse eid="MRK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>Keer girire: «Awuni boor'a saset waasidifetirinso? Nawaas afay'totu afay'tetano aane kituwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Asuni meya dey kanyni mi'a mi'esete. Sinuntano Yesus baassotin zuutire keerun kalle kisaat nawaasi abaninnawa intononna dey barneen ane feese baassotin zoonsire nawa faanaassi giri. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>Nawaasi kushunon dey zatte: «Xalita kum!» yi. Es kaamaasi kota dey: «Garo nawaase kabuwe yifawungwe» uu.<verse eid="MRK 5:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>Bar dey geregere kabira ek hang kuti. Woggabaas dey asire heppe sinana. Es bar sinfana kabaasik asuni meya akamanon diinqesete. <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Sinuntano Yesus: «Sina chowaason oonu arunaata» yire baassok ajajefaat dey: «Nawaas muuna muu imti» yi.<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Raajju Daabaastak Ulfinto Beybaas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat. 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luqa. 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>Yesus estan kesse daabaasta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:1</char><char style="fk" closed="false">Daabaasta: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Daabaasta uus Naaziret uu.</char></note> ye. Nawoni meya orfobaase hamete. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Beysani wonaasik Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi assu ephi. Showo asuni meya odesere diinqeset ekka yisete: «Han asus han wuzason zuutire ayin daniso? Aro arunso han barik imteri? Han biistera artonoy wuzasikitonon zagifenaas aakkakinso? <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Haniis i'o kar'fe Maaramini naastenoso? Yaqobni, Yosani, Yuudanawa Simonna asi ayistenoso? Eetbaasikitonu han innoneen anetanoso faasenari?» Esiison yiset ephphetoo beyesete.<verse eid="MRK 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>Sinuntano Yesus: «Raajju daabaastak, koonbaasa ganesinawa keer ane feena asusa ganesitano oom geroni asusa sinak ulfintowa» yire make.<verse eid="MRK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>Estak dey garo mettanni meenistatu kushubaason ta'ire fatiteno ooma biistera artonoy wuza aane zaguk chime. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>Daraas amano beyobesiisik diinqe. Estan Yesus ke'e ke'eessi kutifaafe assit feer.<verse eid="MRK 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Asire Heppe Wosini Meyanon Wosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat. 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luqa. 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>Asire heppe nawobaasakitonin hang barki teegere hep hep zagire wosi. Kiina ayyanaasikitota ha'suni hugna imi. <verse eid="MRK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/>Estan ekka yire ajaje: «Hamati ugunnitiisik haarotano tusha wedey ha'mato wedey tach'amaasta birri koor'ira ephatiita. <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/>Wochontiissi chaa'ma yer'titano hep maama ephatiita. <verse eid="MRK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/>Isa asuni keer girifeti kabaasik es katamaassin kesatinneen esta footi. <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/>Asuni meya nittotin ephphetooknawa odokna beyete dimaasta wochontiisi tulonon tebaat essin kessa hamti. Es bar dey baassosta zaala sinana.»<verse eid="MRK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Estan es wostere hama baasso dey kesere asuni meyak: «Boor'nitiison harmira Ha'ooski woluti» yit assisete. <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/>Showo kiina ayyana asunisin kissete. Showo mettannin dey zayiti muudfaafe fatisete.<verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Haphqife Yohannisni Worto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat. 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luqa. 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>Yesusni sunaas artera faar sinna boor'a taato Herodis basa chowaason ode. Isa isa meya: «Haphqife Yohannis kitun kabi. Es bari boor'a biistera artonoy wuza barik zagtedifar» <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14</char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yiset feeseter: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yiset feeseter yifa bar isa isa zeemoti tichaassi «yit feer» utu yifa </char></note>yiset feeseter.<verse eid="MRK 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>Oomiis dey: «Eliyaswa» yisete; isakadiis dey: «Zeemoti raajjuni meyaassin isaasamatowa» yiset feeseter.<verse eid="MRK 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Sinuntano Herodis odere: «Han bar ta suutbaason katina Haphqife Yohanniswa. Ese bartu kitun kabirwa» yi. <verse eid="MRK 6:16"/><verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17-18"/>Herodis ayba Filiphosni asu sina Herodiyadanon asu zagire ephi. Haphqife Yohannis Herodisnin: «Ayneesa asunon ephatak neek aane sholsifawa» yire make. Es bari boor'a wosire Haphqife Yohannisnin ootire taatoni keer taati. <verse eid="MRK 6:17-18"/><verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19-20"/>Herodis Haphqife Yohannis ooko dey korto asu sinnamatona arir sinna boor'a digerenawa oodetna feer. Herodis basa wollaason odena odena faadaasik nayettu feefe. Sinuntano giraktu odefe. Es bari boor'a Herodiyas Haphqife Yohannisnin es makena wuzaasik haarera woruk sholefanaknu aane chima.<verse eid="MRK 6:19-20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Herodis koontena wonaason ulfinsuk daason ha'sife baassok; taar'oni gaanynyaniknawa arto Galiilaki meyakna akama koota koote. Es bar dey Herodiya sholefana ma'a wona sini. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22"/>Herodiyadani nawa kootaas maastefana keyaassi girira baasso sina surit eresira Herodisninnawa barneen ane feese baassotinna girsi. Taatoos dey nawaason: «Ne sholeta wuza awunu sinun taan mamsuwe imanawe» yi. <verse eid="MRK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23"/>Hepsa dey: «Taatonaasi isa kununonnu sinfanak mamsita baron zuutira neek imanawe» yire teyi.<verse eid="MRK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Bar dey intobaaski hamma: «Awu mamsunaasse» yi. Intobaas dey: «‹Haphqife Yohannisni teetaason› yira mamsuwe» yi.<verse eid="MRK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>Nawaas dey geregere taatoski wolla hamma: «Haphqife Yohannisni teetaason han koranaassi gedtera hash taak imtonak sholefaungwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Taatoos es mamsina mamsusik akamanon suume. Sinuntano zeemme teyina boor'a muu muusonek teegte asuni meeni sina nawaasik kalanak aane sholowe. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>Geregere taatoos oodfe taar'osasin isarin Yohannisni suutaason kar'e teshshonak wosi. Taar'oos dey hamme taatoni keyaassin suutbaason kar'i. <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>Kar'na teetaason koranaassi gedde teshshosi nawaasik imin nawaas dey intobaasik imi. <verse eid="MRK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>Yohannisni nawoosakito es baron odeseteyse yeesere dugnobaason ephphe kabbarsete.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Uuch Kum Asunin Maasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat. 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luqa. 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoha. 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>Wosini meya wostere hameteessin wolle yeesere Yesusniki sina zuuttesete. Zagsete baronnawa assisete baronna zuutire barik maksete. <verse eid="MRK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>Baassoki yeefernawa wolle hamfe asuna showo sinna boor'a muuni muuknu sa'ati aane danoto. Es bari boor'a Yesus: «Nitto nitto isa shaato dimsi hamfaat garo wona beysa ephtiwa» yi. <verse eid="MRK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>Estan baasso baasso goonuusi diisere isa shaato dimsi hamete.<verse eid="MRK 6:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Sinuntano hamefeen asuni meya biyere baasso sinobesiison arsete. Estan katama katamaassin kesere wochok eelere baasso kar'ono feeseten zeemme hamme baasso kersoneesta zuuttesete. <verse eid="MRK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/>Yesus goonuussin kerefena kabaasik showo asuni biire kezzoba foonto fantune feeseter sinobesiisik suume. Estan showo wuza baassotin assuk kabi. <verse eid="MRK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>Geroki dimaas waalet hambaase nawobaasakito Yesusniki tai'sesere: «Han faani dimaas zabowa; gerok dey waaldifar; <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>Han asuni meya muusone wuza aafa sinna boor'a biratoosta fa beedeessinawa ke'eessina hamere muubesi waagsonek geggessuwa» yisete.<verse eid="MRK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>Sinuntano bar wolgire: «Baasso muusone muuson nitto imtiwa» yi. Baasso dey: «Eekan inno hamma hep tiya diinari zuutira kisira waagera imaniroso?» yisete.<verse eid="MRK 6:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Yesus: «Apun tushanso faari? Hamma biyebbetiso» yi. Baasso dey biyere: «Uuch muuma tushnewa hep qurxumminetu faarwa» yisete.<verse eid="MRK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>Yesus dey daraasi chiro kuwaasta bag bagge duussonek ajaje. <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Estan tiya tiyanawa uuchasir uuchasirna sinefaafe madadak diisete. <verse eid="MRK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Yesus dey ukkoti uuch muuma tushaasewa hep qurxummiise ephphe den sama biire Ha'o galattefaat tushaason batte daraasik woshonek nawobaasakitonik imi. Esiisimato hep qurxummiison imin zuuttambesiise asik haa'esete. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>Zuuttambesiise meesere gawsete. <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>Nawoosakito dey fu'te batto tushaasewa qurxummiise asin asire heppe masa tuumanon zuutisete. <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>Tushaason me arqasusa faada uuch kum sinana.<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Baariista Kuti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat. 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoha. 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Yesus geregere daraasin geggesifet nawobaasakitonin goonuussi diisere yesalo Betesayida finere zeemme hamonek ajaje. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>Esseen orfo Yesus baassostan oor kesse Ha'o shiiphonak aamaasta kesi. <verse eid="MRK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Waalfana kabaasik goonuus baarisi ganetatu fa. Es kabaasik Yesus bar bar daastatu fe. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>Nawobaasakito siru baasso sinaasta siridifar sinna boor'a akaason ichche finak rakkassefeen bi. Wassi izgin sa'atin hamma asire heppe sa'atineen fa kabaassi baariista kutit hang baassoki ye. Baassotinnu aatte hamana kaba. <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>Sinuntano baasso baariista kutit hamfeen biyesefaat: «Kitawa» yisefaat chaagete. <verse eid="MRK 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>Zuuttambesiise biyaat naysete. Yesus dey geregere: «Harewa! Tawa! Digotiitawa» yi. <verse eid="MRK 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>Goonuussi girire baassoneen ane duubaase sirus beyya yere. Es bari boor'a nawoosakito akamanon diinqesete. <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>Nibbesiis yaadato beyya faar sinna boor'a zeemmati zagte biistera artonoy tushaasi chowanon aane arsoto.<verse eid="MRK 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Baariison finere Gensaret yiste daasta kar'ete. Goonuuson ek daasta tai'sire taar'e yeetisete. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>Goonuussin kersefe kabaasik asuni meya geregere Yesusnin arsete. <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>Es daa zuuttambaase asi biratoosta ek hang eelefaafe Yesus feenaasta mettanni meyanon oppota wor'e teshshesete. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Bar hamna hamna dima zuuttambaase asi ke'eessi, katamaassi, beedeessi feese mettanni meyanon ek yaboosta ephetaafe teshsho maybaasi fashanonne ta'usonek shiiphset feeseter. Ta'i baassonu zuuttere farset feeseter.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Abani Meeni Tuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mat. 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Ferisawini meenawa Yerusalemun yeese isa isa Museni tumaasi assinynyaasna Yesusniki yeesere zuuttesete. <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>Yesusni nawoosasin isa isaas tumaasimato mastera kayimnoy kushuk muu meesefeen biyete. Kayimnoy uus mastonoy kushu uu.<verse eid="MRK 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>Ferisawini meenawa oom Ayhudni meena kur'uni meeni tumaason oodak kushubesiison maso shaksefaatene aane meesefe. <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>Esiisimato dey gaban wolsefe kabaasik masonoy aane meesefe. Tuwooson, gimaason, bittak wosuste kodaason, masane fa ooma ooma tumasonneen oodettu feesefe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kupho: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">isa isa tichaas kupho yifa baron daysir.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Es bari boor'a Ferisawini meenawa Museni tumaasi assinynyaasna: «Eekin ne nawoosakito kur'uni meeni tumaason beyefaat awuni boor'a kushubesiison masonoy muu meesefeso» yit Yesusnin mamussete.<verse eid="MRK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6"/>Sinuntano bar wolgire ekka yi: «Nitto sinnoy sinne bestefe asuwa; raajju Isayyas nitto chowaasik makefena kabaasik:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">« ‹Han daraas noonoba noonobaasiktu taan ulfinsifeteno;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">nibbaas tayistan akamanon wokawa.<verse eid="MRK 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7"/>Asu tumena tumaason;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">Ha'onir zagsere assisefaafe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">shimaasiktu taan ulfinsifewa›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">yire makena bar futowa.<verse eid="MRK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>«Nitto Ha'oosi ajajinon beyefaat asuni tumatu oodefetiwa.»<verse eid="MRK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>Dey Yesus tusire: «Nitto tumaason oodakwa iyaat Ha'oosi tumanon beyati ma'a ugunniti faarwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/>Muse: ‹Abanesinnawa intoneesonna ulfinsuwa› Dey: ‹Ababaasin wedey intobaason me'a bar wortonak sholsifa› yifa. <verse eid="MRK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/>Sinuntano nitto ‹Isa asu ababaasin wedey intobaason argasuna wuzba faafaananenawa es baron dey: «Han bar Ha'oosik imna imawa» iyaanane; <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/>Ababaasiknawa intobaasikna argasu beyak chimanawa› yisefeti. <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/>Esiisik teetnitiisi tumanon oodak Ha'oosi kaamanon shaarefeti. Dey effa effa showo wuza zagsefeti.» <verse eid="MRK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>Yesus dey daraasin hepsa barki teegere: «Zuuttamnitiise gasasira taakin odotiwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/>Asuni kiinsifaas asunisin kesfa bartano geron asunisi girifa bar aane kiinsifawa. <verse eid="MRK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16"/>Ese odoni odoba feena bar odowowa!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ese odoni odoba feena bar odowowa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa isa tichaasta faar</char></note> yi.<verse eid="MRK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>Yesus daraasin beyfaat keer hamfena kabaasik nawobaasakito besosi kotanon mamussete <verse eid="MRK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>Bar dey baassok wolgire: «Nitto dey aane gazguwetinoso? Geron asuni katasi girifa bar isanne asunin aane kiinsifa sinnamato aane aruwetinoso? <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/>Kataassi girifa bar gerotu kesfatano nibaassi aane girifawa» yi. Ekka ubaasik Yesus muu zuuttera kayma sinbaason make.<verse eid="MRK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>Tusire dey: «Asunin kiinsifaas asusa nibsin kesfa wuzasikitowa. <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/>Es bar dey mangunon safaro, soolo, wiiso, asuni woru; <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/>Gerkesa, jooro, mangu, esha, gafo, koona, hamato, beeganto, gironata uwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/>Es mangu wuzaasikito zuuttera asuni nibsintu kesfa. Asunin dey kiinsifa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sirofiniqaki Asusi Amanto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat. 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Yesus estan kabire Tirosni katamaasi tesha fa ke'eessi hami. Esta isa keer girire foobaason oonu arunoynamato shole. Sinuntano aachok aane chime. <verse eid="MRK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25"/>Garo nawubaason kiina ayyana ephna isa mashkasu Yesusni chowaason odefaat geregere yaara wochobaassi sagade. <verse eid="MRK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26"/>Asus Sirofiniqawini meeni keena sina Girikni kaamatu wollefa. Bar dey nawubaassin kiina ayyanaason kisunak Yesusni shiiphe. <verse eid="MRK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Sinuntano Yesus: «Naanggotaasi muunon ephphe kanak ha'u ma'arta. Shakaani naanggotaas zeemma maara gawun» yi.<verse eid="MRK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>Asus wolgira: «Futowa Daamtaaso! Kanaasikitonu sillawoosi sikalosi faafaattu naanggotaas maafana kabaasik zigifa fufuntooson maafawa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>Es bari boor'a Yesus barik: «Ekka makoneesik kiina ayyanaas naaneessin kesiwe; maar'o hamme» yi.<verse eid="MRK 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>Asus dey keeba wolla hamma kar'in kiina ayyanaas kesfaan nawaas farira kuphoosta kunfeen dani.<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Odo Oyoosnawa Nibtaatoosna Asi Faru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Estan Yesus Xirosun kesse Sidon kamo aatte asir katama yistefa daastak Galiilani baariiski ye. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Estak isa odoba oyonawa babula asuna asin asuni meya Yesusniki ephphe yeesete. Kushubaason dey basaasta ta'unak shiiphsete. <verse eid="MRK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Yesus asusin daraasatan bar barin oor kisire kushubaasi waa'ak odobaassi gedaat tuja tujere asusa termanon tapti. <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>Den sama kaanne biyaat sikalere safarere «Eefta» yi. Kotbaas dey «gachcho» uu.<verse eid="MRK 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Geregere odobaas gachche. Terumbaas dey kotte. Isa tuusa'o foontonon mai'sire wolle. <verse eid="MRK 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Yesus: «Han baron ooknu makotiita» yire ephphe ye baassok ajaje. Sinuntano baasso makotiita yina baron beyfaat arkissire wolumsesete. <verse eid="MRK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Asuni meya akamanon diinqok: «Zuuttambaase asin ma'ar zagiwa. Odo oyoni meya odosonek; nibtaatoni meya wolumsonek zagi!» yisete.<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Acheech Kuma Asuni Meyanon Maasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat. 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>Es wonaassik showo dara hepsa dey zuutte. Muusone muu aafa sinna boor'a Yesus nawoni meyanon barki teegere: <verse eid="MRK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/>«Daraas hawung keez wona kar'e taneen anetu feesete. Muubesi aafa sinna boor'a baassok safarefawungwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/>Baassossin isa isaas woka daan yeeseter sinna boor'a afur keebesi gafkaanane ugunta gooda taateseterwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>Nawobaasakito dey: «Han zaboossi asu ayin tusha danna han effetena daraasin maasuk chimnirinso?» yire wolugsete. <verse eid="MRK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>Yesus: «Nittoki apun tushanso faari?» yire mamsi. Baasso dey: «Naafun tushatu faarwa» yisete.<verse eid="MRK 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>Daraasin daasta duussonek ajaje. Estan naafun muuma tushaason ephphe Ha'o galattefaat batte woshonek nawobaasakitonik imi. Baasso dey daraasik woshete. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>Baassoki garo qurxummi faar. Es barik Ha'ooson galattefaat woshonek nawobaasakitonin ajaje. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8"/>Nawoosakito dey asuni meya meesere gawseten fu'te battooson inya inya naafun masa tuumanon zuutisete. <verse eid="MRK 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9"/>Tushaason meese asuni meya acheech kum sinone. Estan geggessi.<verse eid="MRK 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>Esseen orfo nawobaasakitoneen goonuussi diisere Dalmanuta yistefa daasta hamete.<verse eid="MRK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Biistera Artonoy Wuza Biyak Mamuste Mamsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mat. 16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>Ferisawini meya Yesusniki yeesere barneen karakkaro ephete. Fattanok sholsefaat biistera artonoy wuza saman besunak mamussete. <verse eid="MRK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/>Basa teetaasik akamanon sikalere safarefaat: «Han koontoos awuni boor'a biistera artonoy wuza sholefaso? Futoktu makefawungwa, han koontoosik isa biistera artonoy wuza aafa imtona wuza» yi. <verse eid="MRK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>Ferisawini meyanon beyfaat hepsi wolle goonuussi diire yesalo fini.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ferisawini Meenawa Herodisni Masose</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat. 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>Nawobaasakito tusha ephphe hama daagsete boor'a goonuussi fayiis isa tushatano ooma aafa. <verse eid="MRK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/>Yesus baassotin: «Ferisawini meenawa Herodisna asi masoossin teetnitiison oodtiwa» yire ajaje.<verse eid="MRK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>Baassotna baassotna: «Innoki tusha aafa sinna boor'awa» yit wolumsete.<verse eid="MRK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>Yesus es baasso safaraason arifaat: « ‹Tusha innoki aafa sinna boor'awa› yit nittotna nittotna awuniron wolumsedifetirinso? Hashneen aane gazguwetinoso? Aane aruwetinoso? Nibnitiis yaadato beyiyoso? <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/>Aafniti feen aane bifetinoso? Odonti feen aane odefetinoso? Nibnitiissi aane kar'fanoso? <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/>Uuch muuma tushaason uuch kum asusik batfana kabaasik fu'te battooson apun masa kabugsetiso?» yi. Baasso dey: «Asire heppe» yisete.<verse eid="MRK 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>Dey «Naafun muuma tushaason acheech kum asunik batfana kabaasik fu'te battooson apun masa kabugsetiso?» Baasso dey: «Naafun» yisete.<verse eid="MRK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>Bar dey: «Hashnu aane aruwetinoso?» yi.<verse eid="MRK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Betesayidak Isa Aaftishunin Fati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Betesayida kar'efe kabaasik asuni meya isa aaftishunin ephphe yeesere Yesus taptunak dey shiiphsete. <verse eid="MRK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Bar dey aaftishuusi kushubaassi zatte ke'eessin gerakalo kisire aaffaassi tujfaat kushubaasik ta'ire: «Isa biidifata wuza faaroso?» yire mamsi.<verse eid="MRK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Aaftishuus den kaanne: «Asusakito kutit yere i'onimato kutisedifeen biidifawungwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>Hepsa Yesus kushubaason aaffaasta ta'i. Estan asus mai'sire bi. Farire woksokneen fa wuzason zuutire mai'sire bi. <verse eid="MRK 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Estan Yesus asusin keeba gafkaat: «Ke'eessi girutaata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:26</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ooknu isa wuza makotaata: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ooknu isa wuza makotaata yifa baron isa isa zeemoti Girikni tichaassi daysir </char></note>» yi.<verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiros Yesusnin: «Ne Muudtowa» Ubaas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat. 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luqa. 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Yesusnawa nawobaasakitona Kesariyani Filiphoos yistefa katamaasi tesha fa ke'esikitosi hamete. Ugnaastak: «Asuni meya ta oo sinnamato maksefeso?» yire nawobaasakitonin mamsi.<verse eid="MRK 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>Baasso dey wolgire: «Isa isaas Haphqife Yohanniswa; oomiis dey Eliyaswa; oomiis dey raajjusasin isaaswa» yiretu maksefewa.<verse eid="MRK 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>«Eekan nittoke; taan oo yifetiso?» yire mamsi. Phexiros wolgire: «Ne Kiristooswa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:29</char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kiristoos: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kiristoos uu Girikni kaama, Ibrayistik Mesi uu. Hepobaase asi kotbaas «Muudto» uu</char></note>» yi.<verse eid="MRK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>Yesus baassok: «Ta chowaason ooniknu makotiita» yire ajaje.<verse eid="MRK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kituna Baron Issoonsa Make</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat. 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luqa. 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>Yesus nawoni meyak ekka yit assu ephi: «Asuni Naa akama shana ephphetoonak sholsifawa. Kur'uni meeni sinak, maagni gaanynyani sinak, Museni tumaasi assinynyani meeni sinak kashistonir dey wortonir. Sinuntano keez wonaneen orfo kitun kabunir.» <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>Es baron dey ammanon baassok make. Es kabaasik Phexiros Yesusnin oor ephphe: «Ekka utaatawa» yit ke'i. <verse eid="MRK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>Sinuntano Yesus nawobaasakitoniki yerqere biyaat Phexirosnin ekka yire ke'i: «Ne Sexana, asusarontano Ha'oosiron aane safarefe sinna boor'a haak orfona hamma.»<verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>Estan Yesus daraasin nawobaasakitoneen ane teegere ekka yi: «Taneen ane hamak shole bar basa teetni safaraason beyowa. Basaasta kar'ni masqalini shanaason wor'e taneen ane hamowa. <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/>Kaabaason fu'ok sholefe bar zuuttere turkuna. Taaknawa misirachchuni kaamaasikna iyaat kaabaason turki bar zuuttere fatuna. <verse eid="MRK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/>Asu han daastaki fa wuzason zuutire danfaat kaabaason turkifaanane barik awu ke'nirinso? <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/>Asu kaabaason furok aro waaga kaasunirinso? <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/>Han amanonoynawa boor'bare yere koontoosi ganesi taaknawa ta kaamaasikna iichchefe bar zuuttambaase Asuni Naa Ababaasa ulfinak korto wosiyaasneen ane yeefena kabaasik barik iichchona.»<verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>Dey Yesus: «Futo nittok makefawungwa; Hanta yerse asuni meyaassin Ha'oosi taato akama hugnak yaafeen biinoyfeegedo kitusonor isa isar feeseterwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Gitoos Soolte</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mat. 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luqa. 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>Issun wonaneen orfo Yesus Phexirosnin Yaqobninnawa Yohannisninna den tega aamaasta baasso baassotin ephphe kesi. Estak baasso sinaasta gitobaas soolte. <verse eid="MRK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>Maybaas dey palpalira fore. Han daastaki maama mei'fe bar oonu kaynuk chimnoynarne faar sinna akamanon fore. <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>Estan Eliyasnawa Musena Yesusneen ane wolumsefeen biyete. <verse eid="MRK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>Phexiros Yesusnik: «Assinynyano! Hanta fooniis innok ma'arwa. Isaron neek isaron Musenik isaron Eliyasnik keez hafo keer'aniwa» yi. <verse eid="MRK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>Akamanon digesete boor'a Phexiros makefena wuzasonnu aane aruwe.<verse eid="MRK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>Shaaru yaara baassotin yinin es shaaruussi: «Keeshtefana Naataas hanifewa! Barin odotiwa!» yifa kaama odte. <verse eid="MRK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>Geregere yerqere biyeten Yesus bar barteno baassoneen oom ooninnu aane biyoto.<verse eid="MRK 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>Aamaastan kersefe kabaasik Yesus: «Asuni Naa kitun kabunanneen han biyeti baron ooniknu maksotiitawa» yire ajaje.<verse eid="MRK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>Basa kaamaason nibbesiissi ephefaat: «Kitun kabu uus aambanso?» yiset baassotna baassotna wolumsete. <verse eid="MRK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/>Baasso dey: «Museni tumaasi assinynyani meya awuni boor'a ‹Eeliyas zeemme yoonak sholsifa yisefeso?› » yit barin mamussete.<verse eid="MRK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>Bar dey wolgire: «Aa; Eeliyas zeemme yeere zuuttambaase asin zeep'ana. Sinuntano Asuni Naa akama shanaason ephphetoonamatonawa kashistonamatona tichchenaas awuni boor'anso? <verse eid="MRK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/>Sinuntano nittok makefawungwa: ‹Eeliyas dey yewa. Barik tichchenaasimato sholseteeson zuutire basaasta zagsete› » yi.<verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kiina Ayyana Ephna Naasin Fati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mat. 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luqa. 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>Ukkoti fu'te nawoni meyaki wolsere yeesefe kabaasik showo dara baasso biratoosta zuuttere feeseten Museni tumaasi assinynyani meya dey baassoneen we'nisefeen bi. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>Geregere daraas zuuttere Yesusni biyeteese diinqesete. Barki eelle naga ooshshesete. <verse eid="MRK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>Yesus dey baassok: «Aro wuzanson baassoneen karakkarsedifetiri?» yit mamsi.<verse eid="MRK 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>Daraasasin isa asu wolgire: «Assinynyano! Niba taar'a ayyana ephna naataasin neeki teshshengwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>Kabfana kabaasik ephphatu ha'ifa; noonobaassi gusa kar'ettu ay'baaso koyfe; dey kongsir; kissonek ne nawoosakitonik makena aane chimoto» yi.<verse eid="MRK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Yesus wolgire: «Amanonoy koonto aageneen nittoneen ane foonarinso? Aageneen nittotin fakunarinso? Hang taaki teshshotiwa» yi. <verse eid="MRK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>Baasso dey naasin barki tessheseten barin biinayse kiina ayyanaas geregere naasin gansira tookonak zagira gusa kar'et daasta bukale. <verse eid="MRK 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>Yesus naasa abanin: «Han bar ephnanneen apun neyanso?» yire mamsi. Asus dey wolgire: «Daagbaaseneengwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>Showo wona tishkunak geyaassinawa akasina gedar. Neek chimtefaanane innok kenashtowa; dey argasuwa» yit shiiphsete.<verse eid="MRK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>Yesus dey: «Chimfaatane yifatoso? Amanefe barik zuuttambaase chimterwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>Geregere naasa aba: «Amanefawungwa! Amanoni hopinaason argasuwa» yit chaagi.<verse eid="MRK 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Yesus dey daraas kuytet yoobaason biyaat kiina ayyanaason: «Ne niba taato; odo oyo ayyanaas naasasin kes! Hepsi wolla girunoytamato ajajefan!» yire ke'i.<verse eid="MRK 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>Naas akamanon tookonak zagira chaagga kesi. Showobesiis: «Kiti» usonenneen dugnone feer sini. <verse eid="MRK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>Sinuntano Yesus kushubaassi zatte kabgin yere.<verse eid="MRK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Yesus keer girinanneen orfo nawobaasakito: «Inno kisuk hopiniis awuni boor'anso?» yire bar barin mamussete.<verse eid="MRK 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>«Han effaas soomoknawa shiiphokna sina shakaanane isanne kesak aafa chimanawuza» yi.<verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kituna Baron Hepsa Make</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat. 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luqa. 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30-31"/>Estan kesere Galiila kamo aatte hamete. Yesus nawoni meyak assit feer sinna boor'a bar feena dimaason oonu arunak aane sholowe. Ekka dey yi: «Asuni Naa asuni meeni kushusi aattere imtok wortere keezsinari wono kitun kabunir.»<verse eid="MRK 9:30-31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>Es chowaas baassok aane galowa. Barin mamsuk dey digsete.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oonso Innoossin Arkir?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat. 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luqa. 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>Yesusnawa nawobaasakitona Kifirnahom yeesete. Keer girsetenneen orfo: «Nittotna nittotna ugnaasta aambanso wolumsetiri?» yire baassotin mamsi.<verse eid="MRK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/>Sinuntano baasso ugunne hamefet: «Zuuttambaase asiisatan arkir oo sinungeso?» yisere wolumsete boor'a shaakkisete. <verse eid="MRK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/>Yesus dey diifaat asire heppeesin barki teegere «sina zeemak sholefe bar zuuttambaase asi orfo sino; dey zuuttambaase asi wostinynya sinanak sholsifa» yi. <verse eid="MRK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>Isa daaga nawa teshshere ganebesiissi yeetaat idimme: <verse eid="MRK 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/>«Haniisne fa daaga naanggotaassin isaason ta sunaasik irba zagire ephpheteefe bar zuuttambaase taan ephphetoonawa. Taan ephpheteefe bar dey zuuttere taan wosi barintu ephpheteeteno taantawa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Innotin Tugga'onoy Bar Innoneengwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luqa. 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>Yohannis Yesusnik: «Assinynyano! Isa asu ne sunaasik kiina ayyanaason kisifeen biyaat innoneen ane sina beyna boor'a kalniwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>Sinuntano Yesus: «Ta sunaasik biistera artonoy wuza wostefaat geregere tayista mangu kaama wollok chimnir aafe sinna boor'a kalatiitawa. <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/>Innotin tugga'onoy bar innoneen anewa. <verse eid="MRK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/>Futo nittok makefawungwa; Kiristoosnir sinti boor'a ta sunaasik isa toofo aka nittok ima bar waagba aafa tishuna wuza» yi.<verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asunik Tuusa Sinaastan Teetni Ooda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat. 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luqa. 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>Tusire dey: «Han taak amanefa garo garo naanggotaassin isaason tuusa'sife bar zuuttere faya wooni shu'a suutbaasta taatera tir'maassi ha'tefaanane ma'ana kabawa. <verse eid="MRK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43"/>Kushunees tuusa'saanane kar'a ha'uwa. Hep kushune faafaan geeni tir'maassi ha'toostan kushu dungu sinna kaani keer giru ma'arwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44"/>[Geeni tir'maas toobaas kitunoynar; geebaas tishunoynarwa]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:44 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Toobaas kitunoynar geebaas tishunoynarwa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Girikni matsafaassi ekka yifar aafa.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45"/>Wochonees tuusa'saanane kar'a ha'uwa. Hep wochone faafaan geeni tir'maassi ha'toostan wocho foonto sinna kaani keer giru ma'arwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46"/>Geeni tir'maas toobaas kitunoynar; geebaas tishunoynarwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:46 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Toobaas kitunoynar geebaas tishunoynarwa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Girikni tichaassi aafa.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47"/>Aafnees tuusa'saanane wo'ira kisuwa. Hep aafne faafaan geeni tir'maassi ha'toneesneen isa aafne faafaan kaani keer giru ma'arwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48"/>Geeni tir'maas toobaas kitunoynar geebaas dey tishunoynarwa.<verse eid="MRK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>«Maa'a zuuttambaase kawok mochera kayimfanaysimato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:49 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Maa'a zuuttambaase kawok mochera kayimfanaysimato: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yifa bar ooma matsafaassi aafa</char></note> asu dey zuuttere geyak kaymanak sholsifa.<verse eid="MRK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/>«Kawo ma'arwa; sinuntano kawo kaar'ba foonto sinfaanane awuk kaatutirinso? Kaantiissi kawoni kaar'a foongwa. Nittotna nittotna isa safarak footi» yi.<verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Asuni Kotni Chowa Assi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mat. 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luqa. 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Yesus estan kabire Yordanosnon finne Yuudaki daasta hami. Showo asu barki esta hepsa zuutteseten zeemoti zagifenaysimato assit feer.<verse eid="MRK 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>Isa isa Ferisawini meya yeesere barin fattanok: «Asu asubaason gafkunak tumaas makewoso?» yire mamussete.<verse eid="MRK 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>Yesus dey wolgire: «Muse nittok aambanso ajajenari?» yi.<verse eid="MRK 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>Baasso dey: «Muse gafkuni tichaason imme gafkunak makewa» yisete.<verse eid="MRK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Yesus wolgire: «Nitto nibaasi chimaktu es ajajiison tichiwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/>Sinuntano ‹Ha'o testoosi tesuta arqarnawa mashkare zagiwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/>Es bari boor'a asu ababaasinnawa intobaasonna beyye asubaasneen isar sinfe. <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/>Hepobesiise isa atutu sinone›. Es bari boor'a baasso isa atutano hanneen ekalo heptewa. <verse eid="MRK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/>Ha'o isar zagina baron ese asu oor kisunaatawa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>Keer girsetenneen orfo nawobaasakito hepsa es chowaason kabugsere mamussete. <verse eid="MRK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/>Yesus dey: «Asubaason gafkaat ooma asu ephfe bar asubaasta gerkesiwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/>Asus dey teegobaaskin kessa oomniki girifaanane gerkesiwa» yit wolgi.<verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Garo Garo Naanggotaason Suusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat. 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luqa. 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Yesus garo garo naanggotaason taptunak asuni meya barki teshshesete. Es teshshe baassotin dey nawobaasakito kalesete. <verse eid="MRK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Sinuntano Yesus biyaat gi'tere: «Garo garo naanggotaas taaki yooson; beyti kalatiita. Ha'oosi taato han barikitone fayisirwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/>Futo nittok makefawungwa; Ha'oosi taatonon daaga nawane faaron zagire ephphetoonoy bar isanne aafawa giruna wuza» yi. <verse eid="MRK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>Idimme kushubaasik ta'ire suusi.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Han Daastaki Otmaasewa Ha'oosi Taatone</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat. 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luqa. 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Yesus ugna hamanak kesfeen isa asu barki eelle yeere sinba kaa'nefaat: «Garam assinynyano! Koi'ba foonto kaa dananak awu zagunarinso?» yit mamsi. <verse eid="MRK 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Yesus wolgire ekka yi: «Awuniron taan garam yifasso? Isa Ha'oosneen ooma garama aafawa. <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/>Ajajiis dey: ‹Kaa worutaata, gerkesataata, wiisotaata, esha zaala makotaata, asunin eshataata, abanesinnawa intoneesonna asin ulfinsu› yifanamato aritarwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>Asus wolgire: «Assinynyano! Es baron zuutira garonaaseneen ooddatu fawungwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Yesus biire keeshte; dey ekka yi: «Isa wuzatu neekin yo'irwa. Hamfaat fa otumneeson zuutira kisira waagaat tukamni meyak imma. Den samak otma danatawa. Eekaat yeen taneen ane hamniwa» yi. <verse eid="MRK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>Sinuntano es chowaasik sinbaas karaye. Akama otumba faar sinna boor'a suumet hami.<verse eid="MRK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Yesus yerqere biyaat nawoni meyak: «Otumbesi faana baassok Ha'oosi taatosi giru awune faaron tiir'onso!» yi.<verse eid="MRK 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>Nawoni meya es makena kaamaasik diinqesete. Sinuntano Yesus tusire: «Naanggotno! <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Waagak amanefe baassok: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yifa bar isa isa zeemoti Girikni tichaassi faar.</char></note> Ha'oosi taatosi giru awune fa tiir'onso! <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/>Otum asu Ha'oosi taatosi girubaastan gaala marufni aafsi kamo aatbaastu kashowa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>Nawoni meya zeemotiistan akamanon diinqesefaat baassotna baassotna: «Esenu oo faruk chimnirinso?» yisete.<verse eid="MRK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Yesus baassotin biyaat: «Futoosik han bar asunik aafa chimtona wuza. Sinuntano Ha'oosik chimter. Ha'oosik zuuttambaase chimterwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>Phexiros dey: «Esenu inno zuuttambaase beyya neneen ane yaaniwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>Yesus wolgire: «Futok nittok makefawungwa; taaknawa misirachchuni kaamaasikna keebaason wedey aybaasakitonin wedey eetbaasikitonon wedey intobaason wedey ababaasin wedey <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Asubaason: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yifa bar isa isa zeemoti Girikni tichaassi faar. Ooma tichaassi aafa</char></note> naanggotbaason wedey bulobaason beya bar daysire dananawa. <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/>Hash han neyaasik kabugtok keyaason, ayisakitonin, eetisikitonon, intoosikitonon, naanggotaason, bulooson tiya kushunon danana. Yooni neyaasik dey koi'ba foonto kaa dannor oonu aafewa. <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/>Sinuntano sina zeemme fe showoni meya orfo wolsone. Orfo wollefe baasso dey sina zeemone» yi.<verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Keezsa Kituni Chowaason Make</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat. 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luqa. 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>Den Yerusalem hamfa ugnaasik hamefeen Yesus sina zeemet feer sinna boor'a nawobaasakito diinqesete. Orfobaase hama baasso dey digset feeseter. Hepsi dey asire heppe nawobaasakitonin barki tai'sire basaasta kar'anak fa chowaason baassok mako ephi. <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>«Ese Yerusalem hamnirwa. Asuni Naa maagni gaanynyaniknawa Museni tumaasi assinynyani meyakna aattere imtonir. Baasso dey kituni mangsuni kar'a basaasta kar'oner. Aazabni meyak aatire imoner. <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/>Baasso dey kanyoner, tujosoner, ichoner dey worsoner, Sinuntano keez wonaneen orfo kitun kabunir» yi.<verse eid="MRK 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaqobnawa Yohannisna Asi Mamsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat. 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Esseen orfo Zabdiyosni naanggot Yaqobnawa Yohannisna Yesusniki yeesere: «Assinynyano! Inno mamsuni chowaason zuutira zagutak sholefeniwa» yisete.<verse eid="MRK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>Yesus dey: «Nittok awu zagunakinso sholefetiri?» yi.<verse eid="MRK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>Baasso dey wolgire: «Ne taatosi ulfintoni kabaasik isarniis oi'ta teshneesta isarniis dey alda teshneesta duunik ma'i uwa» yisete.<verse eid="MRK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>Sinuntano Yesus: «Mamsifeti baron aane arifetiwa. Ta ushanak fa shanani ushaason; ta haphuktonak fa haphuktooson haphuktotik chimatiroso?» yi.<verse eid="MRK 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>Baasso dey: «Aa, chimaniwa» yisete. Yesus: «Ta ushanak fa ushaason ushati; Ta haphuktonak fa haphuktooson haphuktotiwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/>Sinuntano o'itnaastanawa alidnaastana duus hoorena baassoktano es baron imniis tatewa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Fu'te asir nawoosakito odesere Yaqobniistanawa Yohannisnistana gi'tesete. <verse eid="MRK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/>Yesus asire heppe nawoosakitonin barki teegere ekka yi: «Aazabni meeni gaanynya yistefe baasso darabesiisin hugnak ha'sisefemato arsefeti. Esiisimato dey zoonsisefe baasso dey es daraasata ha'suni tuuma hugnabesi faanamatona arsefeti. <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/>Sinuntano nittokik ekkatawa. Nittoossin arkir sinak sholefe bar nitto wostinynya sinowa. <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/>Nittoossin oonu zeemak sholefe bar zuuttamnitiise asi boz sinowa. <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/>Esiisimato Asuni Naasnu wostonaknawa kaabaason showoni meyanon furok aatire imanaktano barik wostosonekna aane yowewa.»<verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Aaftishu Bertemewosnin Fati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat. 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luqa. 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Yesus nawoni meyaneen Iyyariko yeesete. Estan kesefeen showo dara baassoneen ane hamedifer. Ugnaasi ha'ta dey Temewosni naa aaftishu Bartemewos diifaat shiiphet feer. <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>Naaziretki Yesus sinbaason odenayse: «Dawitni zalaassin koonte Yesusno! Taan maarowa» yit chaaga ephi.<verse eid="MRK 10:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>Showo asuni meya shaakkunak ke'isete. Sinuntano bar: «Dawitni zalaassin koonte naaso taak kenashtowa» yit aatamsire chaagi.<verse eid="MRK 10:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Yesus yerefaat: «Teegotiwa!» yi. Baasso dey Aaftishusin: «Harewa! Kabuwa neen teegedifewa!» yit teegsete.<verse eid="MRK 10:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>Bar dey geregere kabire tukaastaki maybaason ha'aat Yesusniki ye.<verse eid="MRK 10:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>Yesus wolgire: «Awu neek zagunak sholefasso?» yi. Aaftishuus dey: «Assinynyano! Biyanakwa!» yi.<verse eid="MRK 10:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>Yesus dey: «Hamma, amantonees neen fatiwa» yi. Geregere biyet ugunne basa orfoose hami.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Akama Ulfinak Yerusalem Giri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat. 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luqa. 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoha. 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>Yesusnawa nawobaasakitona Yerusalem tai'sesefe kabaasik Betefagenewa Bitaniyane asiissi kamo Dabrazayitini kumaasta kar'ete. Estan nawobaasasin heppin ekka yit wosi. <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>«Ek sinnitiista fa ke'eessi hamti. Esta kar'etiise oonu barista duunoyna hanyani nawa tuptera yerefeen danati. Kotta hang ephpha yootiwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/>Oonu: ‹Awagan han baron zagidifetirinso?› iyaanane ‹Daamiisik sholsina boor'a, hash geregere wolgire gafkuna› » uti.<verse eid="MRK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Baasso dey hameten hanyani nawa ugnaasi teshta keeni fochata tuptera yerefeen danere kotete. <verse eid="MRK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>Esta yerse baassossin isa isaas: «Hanyaasi nawanon awuniron kotdifetirinso?» yisete.<verse eid="MRK 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>Baasso dey Yesus ajajenaasimato maksete. Asuni meya dey wolle beyete. <verse eid="MRK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>Nawoosakito hanyaason Yesusniki ephphe yeesete. Maybesiison geshobaasta kunusseten barista di. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>Showo asuni meya maybesiison ugnaasta yiir'ete. Oomiis dey i'oni tosha kiir'e yiir'et feeseter. <verse eid="MRK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/>Sina zeema baassonawa orfobaase yeesefe baassona zuuttere: «Hosana! Daamiisa sunak yeefe bar suustowa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Hosana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hosana uus galata, gira, ulfina sir foobaasontu besifa.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>Daamiisa sunak yooni abani Dawitni taatoos suustowa. Hosana den samak» yit chaaget feeseter.<verse eid="MRK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Yesus Yerusalemki betemeqdesiissi giri. Biratere zuuttambaase asin biinanneen orfo gerok waaldifar sinna boor'a asire heppe nawobaasakitoneen Bitaniya hami.<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Erwina Belesini I'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mat. 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Wonotiri wono Bitaniyan kesefeen Yesus makte. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>Toshbare yere belesini i'o woksok biyaat gaana barissin bestonitto iyaat barki hami. Sinuntano gaanfana asba sina beyna boor'a tosha toshatano isanne danna gaana aafa. <verse eid="MRK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>Es bari boor'a belesiison: «Hawungneen ekalo oonu neekin isanne gaana muunaatawe» yi. Nawobaasakito dey es baron odesete.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Betemeqdesiissi Nagadefe Baassotin Kalle Kisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat. 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luqa. 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoha. 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>Yerusalem kar'efe kabaasik betemeqdesiisi ojni keerkalo girire estak kisire waagsefe baassotinnawa geron waagsefe baassotinna kalle kisu ephi. Waaga soolet fe baasso tarabbezasonnawa nakalo waagefe baasso kodaasonna shelgire ha'i. <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>Estan Yesus: «Oonu isa wuza wor'e betemeqdesiisi keerkalo girunaatawa» yi. <verse eid="MRK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/>Dey esta fe asusik assifena kabaasik ekka yi: «‹Keenaas dara zuuttambaase asi Ha'oni shiiphoni keyawa› yistera aane tichchowanoso? Sinuntano nitto bo'inynyani dugadug zagitiwa.»<verse eid="MRK 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>Maagni meeni gaanynyani meenawa Museni tumaasi assinynyaasna es baron odesete. Daraasneen zuuttere basa assusik diinqet feeseter sinna boor'a Yesusnin digsete. Es bari boor'a aakkak worsonemato sholset feeseter.<verse eid="MRK 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>Waalfana kabaasik dey Yesusnawa nawobaasakitona katamaassin gerakalo kesete.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Belesini I'ooskin Beste Aru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mat. 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>E'so wonsak ugunne hamefeen belesiis tasbaasneen ichimma diifen biyete. <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/>Phexiros nibbaasta kejfaan: «Assinynyano! Ne erwita belesiis ichimiwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Yesus baassok wolgire ekka yi: «Ha'oosik amanotiwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/>Futo nittok makefawungwa; Oonu nibaassi sinungaso unoy makona bar zagtonamato amanere han aamaason: ‹Waatera baariissi ha'towe› iyaanane barik sinanawa. <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/>Es bari boor'a shiiphok mamsiti wuzason zuutira dantir zagira amanotiwa nittok sinana. <verse eid="MRK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/>Shiiphefeti kabaasik den samak fe Abantiis boor'nitiison feeshun unak asuniista isa chowniti faafaanane feeshun utiwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26"/>Sinuntano nitto asusa mangsunon feeshun uu shakaatine den samak fe Abantiis boor'nitiison aafa feeshun unawuza.»<verse eid="MRK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Ha'suni Hugnaas Ayin Sinnamato Mamuste Mamsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat. 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luqa. 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Hepsa dey Yerusalem yeesete. Yesus betemeqdesiissi kutifeen maagni gaanynyani meya, Museni tumaasi assinynyanawa kur'uni meena barki yeesere: <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>«Han baron awuni ha'suni hugnakinso zagidifatari? Wedey han baron zagutak ha'suni hugna neek imar oonso?» yit mamsisete.<verse eid="MRK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Yesus dey: «Ta isa mamsu nittotin mamsunawa. Es mamsunaason wolgifaatine ta dey han baron awuni ha'suni hugnak zagifanamato nittok makonawa. <verse eid="MRK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/>Yohannisni haphquus Ha'ooskin yaaringwa wedey asunikininso?» yi.<verse eid="MRK 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>Baassotna baassotna ekka yisete: «Ha'okin yaar iyaanine eekin awuniron bar makena baron amano beytiso? unir. <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>Ese asunikin uniroso?» ekka usonoytemato asu zuuttere Yohannisnin futoosik Ha'oni raajjuwa yiset feeseter sinna boor'a daraasin digsete. <verse eid="MRK 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Yesusnik wolgire: «Aane arifeniwa» yisete. Yesus dey: «Ta dey awuni ha'suni hugnak han baron zagifanamato aafawa nittok makona wuza» yi.<verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Wayinini Foshaastaki Bulinynyani Meeni Beso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat. 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luqa. 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>Besok dey assunak kabi: «Isa asu wayinini shaa tokke, oja ojje, gaanbaason ti'una doo'a yiishshe, toolo keer'i. Estan bulinynyani meyak kira imaat woka dima hami. <verse eid="MRK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/>Kephtona wonba kar'fana kabaasik gaanbaastan ephphe yoonak wostinynyaasin bulinynyani meyaki wosi. <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/>Baasso dey ephphe ichere kushkush gafuksete. <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/>Hepsa oom wostinynyanin baassoki wosi. Es barin dey ichche teetbaason kar'ere salphisire gafuksete. <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/>Tusire oomnin wosi; es barin dey worsete. Oom showonin wosin isa isaasin ichesete dey isa isaasin worsete. <verse eid="MRK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>Fu'te isa keeshtefena naabaasin: ‹Naataasin baassoki wosaanane ulfinsubesiwa› iyaat zuuttambesiise asi orfoosta wosi. <verse eid="MRK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>Sinuntano es bulinynyani meya baassotna baassotna: ‹Foshaason tooniis han barwa! Yaani woraat foshaason innor zaguniwa› yisete. <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/>Estan ephphe worsere wayiniisi foshni gerakalo ha'sete. <figure style="fig" alt="Woman with child bringing grapes to wine press" file="LB00106B.tif" size="span" ref="12:8">Isa asu wayini ti'tefana doo'a yishshe hoossi </figure><verse eid="MRK 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>«Ese wayiniisi daam awu zagunirinso? Yeere bulinynyani meyanon woraat wayiniisi foshanon oomni meyak imanawa. <verse eid="MRK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10"/>Ese:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">« ‹Shu'ni keyaason keer'fe baasso gonesete shu'aas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">shu'ni keyaasi kajjata duuni sholsu shu'a siniwa.<verse eid="MRK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11"/>Es barnu Daamiiskintu siniwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">biife innoknu akamanon diinqiwa!› »</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">yifa tichaason aane feretira biyetinoso?<verse eid="MRK 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>Maagni gaanynyani meya, Museni tumaasi assinynyanawa kur'uni meena es makena besos baassosta sinbaason arsete boor'a barin ephphe taar'ak sholsete. Sinuntano daraasin digsefaat beyye hamete.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Girboni Chowaasik Mamuste Mamsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat. 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luqa. 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>Wolumbaasik barin ephak isa isa Ferisawini meyakinnawa Herodisni keen sina baassotinna Yesusniki wosisete. <verse eid="MRK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>Barki yeesere: «Assinynyano! Ne futonir sintamato arifeniwa. Asuni sina biira korunoy wedey asu awu una uuk zagifata wuza aafawa. Futok Ha'oosi ugnanontu assifatwa. Makowa, Roomni taate meeni taatoosik girboni ima sholsungwa wedey sholsutanso? Imaniringwa wedey kalanirinso?» yit mamussete.<verse eid="MRK 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Sinuntano bar sirbesiissiki mangunon araat: «Awuni boor'a taan wollak takalok sholefetiso? Isa saantibi teshsheni biyungwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>Baasso dey teshshesete. Yesus dey: «Han gitoosewa tichbaase oonirinso?» yire mamsi. Baasso dey: «Roomni taate meeni taatoosarwa» yisete.<verse eid="MRK 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>Yesus dey: «Ese taatoosaron taatoosik; Ha'oosiron Ha'oosik imtiwa» yi. Wolgubaasik dey diinqesete.<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kitun Kabuni Chowaasik Kabi Mamsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat. 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luqa. 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>«Kitun kabu aafa» yisefe isa isa Seduqawini meya barki yeesere ekka yit mamussete: <verse eid="MRK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/>«Assinynyano! ‹Isa asu nawa koonunoy asubaason ha'aat kitifaanane aybaas dey es asuson ephphe zalba sinanak aybaasik koonuwo› yire Muse innok tichi. <verse eid="MRK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Ese naafun ayni meya feeseter. Tesuni bar asu ephphe nawa koonunoy kiti. <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>Hepsaas dey ephphe nawa koonunoy kiti. Esiisimato Keessaas dey ekka sini. <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>Naafunobesiise asuson ephphe nawa koonunoy kitisete. Zuuttambesiise asi orfota asus dey kiti. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>Asuson naafunobesiise ephete sinna boor'a kitun kabuni wono baassossin oonik asu sinnirinso?»<verse eid="MRK 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Yesus wolgire ekka yi: «Tichaasonnawa Ha'oosi hugnanonna aane arifeti sinna boor'a daagefetiwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/>Kiti baasso kitun kabsefe kabaasik den samak faase Ha'oosi wosinimatotu foosonetano ephne girune aafa. <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/>Sinuntano kituni meya kitun kabsonemato Ha'oos: ‹Ta Abrahamni Ha'o, Yisaqni Ha'o, Yaqobni Ha'owa› yit es saabaassiki geyaasi chowak makefa dimaasta Musenik makena baron Museni tichaassi aane feretira biyetinoso? <verse eid="MRK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/>Bar hayewni meeni Ha'otano kituni meeni Ha'otawa. Es bari boor'a nitto akamanon daagefetiwa.»<verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zuuttambaase Asiistan Denalo Sina Ajaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat. 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luqa. 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>Museni tumaasi assinynyaasasin isaas baasso karakkaroson ode. Yesus ma'aron wolgubaason gasasifaat barki yeere: «Zuuttambaase asiistan denalo sholsu ajajiis aaffarinso?» yire mamsi.<verse eid="MRK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>Yesus wolgire: «Ajaji zuuttambaase asiistan denaloos: ‹Israelno odowa! Inno Daama Ha'oniis isa Daamawa. <verse eid="MRK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/>Ne dey tuuma nibneesik, tuuma kaaneesik, tuuma safaraneesik, tuuma hugnaneesik Daama Ha'oneeson shungwa› yifarwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/>Hepsa ajajiis dey ekkawa: ‹Wolkoneesin ne neen shunfataasimato shungwa› Esiistan denalo ooma ajaji aafawa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/>Tumaasi assinynya wolgire: «Ma'arwa; Assinynyano! ‹Ha'oos isarwa; barneen ooma Ha'o aafawa› yira futok wolgitwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/>Tuuma nibak, tuuma safarak, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:33 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Tuuma kaak: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tuuma kaak yifa bar zeemoti isa isa Girikni matsafaastak aafa.</char></note> tuuma hugnak baron shun. Dey Wolkoneesin teetneeson shunfataasimato shuna kiichchefa maa'aastannawa ooma ooma imaastanna denalowa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>Asus aruk wolginamato Yesus araat: «Ne Ha'oni taatoossin wokka faatartawa» yi. Esseen orfo oonu mamsuni mamsuk aane chime.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosni Chowaasik Mamuste Mamsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat. 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-46">Luqa. 20:41-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Yesus betemeqdesiissi assifet ekka yi: «Museni tumaasi assinynyani meya: ‹Kiristoos Dawitni zalaassin koonte naawa› aakkak yisefeso? <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/>Dawit teetbaasik Korto Ayyanak zoonustere makefena kabaasik:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">« ‹Daamiis Daamtaasik gumaneesakitonin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">wochoneesi sikalosi yer'atak zaguna kabaneen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">oi'ta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:36</char><char style="ft" closed="false">10:38 faadaasta biiti.</char></note> teshnaasta duwa› yi.<verse eid="MRK 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>«Dawit teetbaasik ‹Daamta› utu yiwa. Eekan aakkak Dawitni zalaassin koonte naaba sinnirinso?» Showo daraas dey girak odeset feeseter. <verse eid="MRK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>Yesus assifena kabaasik ekka yi: «Dicha dicha maya mayye ek hang kutu, gabaastak asu naga ooshshonak sholsefe tumaasi assinynyani meyakin teetnitiison oodtiwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/>Baasso Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaasik tega koda, koota maastefanaasta tega dimatu sholsefewa. <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/>Dicha tukama asusikitonon fa wuzbaason ephefe. Dey dicha shiiphoni shiiphok biistokwa iyaat es effatena wuza zagsefe baasso akama mangsuni kar'atu ephphetoosonewa.»<verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tukama Dicha Asusi Ima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luqa. 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Yesus imte ima zuuttefana saaxiniisi sinta diifen asuni meya waaga sir ha'sefeen bi. Showo otumni meya akama waaga imet feeseter. <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>Isa tukama dicha asu waagbaas isa duude sinna hep garo garo naasini saantibi imi. <verse eid="MRK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Nawoni meyanon teegere: «Futo nittok makefawungwa, waagbesiison ima baasso zuuttambesiise asiistan denalo han tukama asus arkissira imiwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/>Zuuttambesiise baassok hoorera fu'tesontu imetewa. Sinuntano han asus tukama sinfaat barik fayiison fu'onoy zuutira imiwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Betemeqdesiis Boktonamato Yesus Make</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat. 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luqa. 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Yesus betemeqdesiissin kesfeen nawoni meyaassin isaas: «Assinynyano! Han shu'asikitonewa han shu'ni keyaasikitone awune fa diinqi sinnamato biwa» yit make. <verse eid="MRK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Yesus dey wolgire: «Han inya inya shu'ni keyaasikitonon biidifatoso? Han shu'aasikito isa isaasta diira fui'tonir aafawa. Zuuttera bokterwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Shananewa Kabugtone</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat. 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luqa. 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Yesus betemeqdesiisi sinta fa Dabrazayitini kumaasta diifen Phexiros, Yaqob, Yohannisnawa Andriyasna baasso baasso barki tai'sere: <verse eid="MRK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>«Han bar aagenso sinanari? Han bar zuuttambaase sinfana kabaasik besobaas aambanso? Innok makowa» yire mamussete.<verse eid="MRK 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Yesus dey ekka yi: «Oonu nittotin eshnoynamato teetnitiison oodtiwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/>Showoni meya: ‹Ta Kiristooswa› yit ta sunaasik yoosone. Showoni meyanon dey eshone. <verse eid="MRK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/>Neeboni chownewa neeboni odune odefeti kabaasik digotiitawa. Es bar dey sinanak faarwa. Sinuntano koi'baas hashtawa. <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/>Daraas daraasata; taatoos taatoosta kabuna. Showo dimta dey daani shorkonewa makne sinana. Es bar dey akama keektoni tesuwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>«Nitto dey teetnitiison oodtiwa. Shonggoni kuphamaasta nitto aattera imtoti. Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassik ichchosoti. Zaala sinatik taakwa iyaat ha'sife baasso sinanawa taate meena asi sinana yeroti. <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/>Es bar sinbaasneen zeemma misirachchuni kaamaas dara zuuttambaase asik maktonak sholsuwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/>Nittotin ephphe aatire imefe kabaasik: ‹Awutaaso makoni?› uuk zeemma rakkatotiitawa. Sinuntano es kabaasik nittok imtoni baron makoti. Makoniis dey Korto Ayyanatano nittotewa. <verse eid="MRK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>Ayiis aybaasin, abaas naabaasin kituk aatire imana. Naanggotaas kooni aba intoosta manguk kabsera worsona. <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/>Asu zuuttambaase asi sina ta sunaasi boor'a oomtester sinati. Sinuntano koi'ba kar'ananneen chimme yere bar faruna.<verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>«Dey <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Raajju Danielnik makte: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa isa zeemoti Girikni tichaasta «raajju Danielnik makte» yifar faar.</char></note> zina wuzaas kayma dimaason kiinifa barik sholsunoy dimaasta yerefeen biyaatine [feretife bar yaadatowowa]. Es kabaasik Yuudak feese baasso aamaaski eeloto. [Zinaas korto dimaasta yerefeen biifeti kabaasik feretife bar gasasuwowa] <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/>Keyaasi tukta fe bar daa kerere isa wuza ephak keer girunaata. <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/>Foshaasta fe bar maybaason ephanak orfo wolunaata. <verse eid="MRK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/>Es kabaasik naanerisewa nawa tanifa asusikitone yerefawungwa! <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/>Sinuntano es wonaas yeeshussi sinnoynamato shiiphoti. <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/>Es kabaasik Ha'o tesina testoostan kabira hash hawungneen kar'a biistonor wedey hanneennu sinnoy shana sinana. <verse eid="MRK 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>Daamiis es wonaasikitonon kawunsu shaki sinfaanane asha mayo asu zuuttambaase fui'tona kabatawa. Sinuntano bar korina asuni meeni boor'a wonaasikitonon kawunsi.<verse eid="MRK 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/>«Es kabaasik oonu sino: ‹Kiristoos hanta feerwa› wedey ‹Ekesta feerwa› yifaanane amanotita. <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/>Esh Kiristoosni meenawa esh raajjuni meena yoosoner. Es baasso chimtefaanane Ha'o korina baassotinnu daagsuk besonewa biistera artonoy wuzne zagsone. <verse eid="MRK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/>Esiisiktu ta zuuttambaase asin zeemma nittok maken sinna boor'a teetnitiison oodtiwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosni Hepsa Wolle Yoo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat. 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luqa. 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>«Es kabaasik es shanaasneen orfo: ‹Awaas talmona; assaas dey aafa chaarona wuza. <verse eid="MRK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/>Baakuraasikito saman zigtosona; samak fa hugnaasikito dey shorkona› <verse eid="MRK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/>Es kabaasik Asuni Naa akama hugnaknawa ulfinakna shaaruussi yeefeen biyone. <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/>Bar dey Ha'oosi wosiyanon wosire daa daassin, daasi diltan kabira daasi koi'ta kar'e fe barik korte asuni meyanon zuutuna.<verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Belesini I'oostan Aruti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat. 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luqa. 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>«Besoson belesini i'oostan aruti. Waay'baas tosha kotta toshbaas dey boodefana kabaasik kawo tai'senamato arifetiwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/>Esiisimato nitto es bar zuuttambaase sinin biifeti kabaasik Asuni Naani yoo tai'sera finynyaassi kar'namato arutiwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/>Futo nittok makefawungwa; es bar zuuttambaase sinnoyfeen han koontoos aafa aatana wuza. <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/>Samaasewa daase aatana. Sinuntano kaamnaasikito aafa aatana wuza.<verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daamiis Wolle Yoona Wonaas Aane Artefa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mat. 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>«Sinuntano es wonaasi chowanon wedey es sa'atiisi chowanon Abaasteno samaki Ha'oosi wosiyaas wedey Naas aane arife. <verse eid="MRK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/>Es wonaas aage sinanamato aane arifeti sinna boor'a guzira oodti <verse eid="MRK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/>Esiis dey Keebaason beyfaat ooma daa hama asusne faarwa. Bar dey wostinynyabaasakito wostosonak wosto haa'e imaat keyaason oodfe barin dey: ‹Guzira oodwa› yire ajaje. <verse eid="MRK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>Es bari boor'a keyaasi aba aage yoonirto aane arifeti sinna boor'a teetnitiison oodti. Awuzakne waalin wedey daani kixxe wedey ako oorifena kabaasik wedey wonsa wassi sinak chimana. <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/>Diinqone yeere kunfeni dannoynamato guzutiwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/>«Nittok makenaasimato oomisikneen zuutira ‹guzuti› yira makefawungwa.»<verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesusnin Woruk Zagte Mekama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat. 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luqa. 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoha. 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>Ayhudni faasikasewa kixxa maastefana heeboose zagtonak hep wona fui'tera faar. Maagni gaanynyanawa Museni tumaasi assinynyaasna Yesusni ephphe worsone manguni ugna sholset feeseter. <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>Sinuntano baasso: «Daraas faasso kabguba, han heeboossi aafa zaguniwuza» yisete.<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusnin Shitto Woshshi Asu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat. 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoha. 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>Yesus Bitaniya yiste ke'e zeemo awataatoni mettan sina Simonni keer diifer. Esta muuni muuk diifen isa mashkasu waagba akama chima shunto naardosini toshakin wosuste shitto albastiros yistefa shu'ak wosuste bilqadisi tuumanon ephpha ya. Bilqadisi ukanon mesira shittooson Yesusni teetaasta wuuki. <verse eid="MRK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4"/>Es Simonni keer diise asuni meeni ganeyaassin isa isaas zagte barik gi'tesere: «Han shittoos baak wuuktera ke'nor sinnaas awuni boor'anso? <verse eid="MRK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5"/>Waagtefaanane isa wogga wosuste wostoni birrineen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Oomaasta keez tiya diinari: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yifar faar</char></note> denalo waagtera tukamnik imtok chimtona kabawa» yisesete. Asuson dey ke'isete. <figure style="fig" alt="Alabaster jars" file="HK00142B.tif" size="span" ref="14:5">Albasxirosni bilqadi </figure><verse eid="MRK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Sinuntano Yesus: «Beytiwa! Awuniron baron rakkisidifetirinso? Bar taak ma'a wuza zagiwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/>Tukamni meya wonna wonna nittoneen anetu feesete sinna boor'a sholeti wono argasutik chimatiwa. Sinuntano ta wonna wonna nittoneen ane aafawa foona wuza. <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/>Han asus bar chimnayson taak zagiwa. Ashnaas moogsi girunak hoossuk zeemma shittok woshshi. <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/>Ta futo nittok makefawungwa; Han misirachchuni kaamaas daasi biratota zuuttambaase asiista maktefana dima aaffaristanu han asus zagina bar baron safaronir sinna maktonawa.»<verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuuda Yesusnin Aatire Imak Merke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat. 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luqa. 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Asire heppe nawoosasin isa Askorotki Yuuda Yesusnin aatire imak maagni gaanynye meyaki hami. <verse eid="MRK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>Baasso dey es baron odeseteyse girsete. Waaga dey imonek abdi imete. Es bari boor'a Yuuda dey Yesusnin aatire imana ugna sholet feer.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daamiisa Meeta'u</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat. 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luqa. 22:7-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoha. 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>Ayhudni faasikani fantu shuktera kixxa maastefana heeboosi tesuni wonaasta nawoni meya Yesusniki yeesere: «Faasika maastefa meeta'uson muutak ay hamma hoossunik sholefasso?» yit mamussete.<verse eid="MRK 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>Yesus dey nawoosasin heppiisin wosire: «Ek katama hamti. Estak dey akani gima wor'o asunin uphoti. Basa orfoose hamti. <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/>Bar hamme girina keyaassi girifaat keyaasi abanin: ‹Assinynyaas, nawotaasneen ane faasikani muuson muuna irbani keya ayfaso?› yifewa uti. <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/>Bar segenetiista<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Segeneti uus Ayhudni meeni tumak keyaasi tukta keete keya</char></note> hoorera yiitera di taga keya nittok besuna. Esta hoossuti» yi.<verse eid="MRK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>Es nawoosakito katamaassi hamere makenaasimato danere faasikani muuson hoossisete.<verse eid="MRK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Waalfana kabaasik Yesus asire heppe nawobaasneen ane ye. <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/>Diisefa meesefeen: «Nittok futo makefawungwa; nittoossin isaas han taneen meefe bar taan aatire imnir» yi.<verse eid="MRK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Baasso dey suumesere isa isarbesiis: «Ta sinungataaso?» yiset Yesusnin mamussesete.<verse eid="MRK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>Yesus wolgire: «Asire heppesasin isaas han taneen ane koranaassi dukire meefe barwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/>Asuni Naa barik tichchenaasimato kitunak faar. Sinuntano Asuni Naanin aatire imni es asus haybubawowa. Es asus koonto shaki sinfaanane ma'arwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daamiisa Meeta'uni Tuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat. 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luqa. 22:14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>Meesefeen Yesus tushaason ephphe Ha'o galattefaat batte: «Ese, haniis ashnaaswa» yire nawoosakitonik imi.<verse eid="MRK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>Tofoosonn dey ephphe Ha'o galattefaat imi. Zuuttere es toofoossin ushete. <verse eid="MRK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/>Ekka dey yi: «Han bar showoni meyak wuuktoni teyyani harinnaaswa.<verse eid="MRK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/>«Futo nittok makefawungwa; Ha'oosi taatoni ha'susi gaddo wayinini ushaason ushana kabaneen han barissin hepsi aafa ushanawuza.» <verse eid="MRK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>Esseen orfo galatni gaama gaamere ek Dabrazayitini kumaasta kesete.<verse eid="MRK 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiros Mormonamato Yesus Zeemme Make</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat. 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luqa. 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoha. 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>Yesus nawobaasakitonik: « ‹Keemeriisin ichcha woruna; fantuusikito dey siktona› yistera tichchena boor'a zuuttera ha'aat eelatiwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/>Sinuntano ta kitun kabinanneen orfo ek Galiila zeemma hamana» yi.<verse eid="MRK 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>Phexiros dey: «Zuuttambesiise ha'aat eelefeknu ta aafa ekka zaguna wuza» yi.<verse eid="MRK 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Yesus dey: «Futo neek makefawungwa; hawung han waalaasik ako heppa wolle oorunoyfeen ne keeza wolla mormotawa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>Phexiros kaambaason chinire: «Neneen ane kitunannu sinfaanane aafa mormona wuza» yi. Zuuttere dey basaasimato maksete.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Getesemani Yistefa Dimaasta Shiiphe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat. 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luqa. 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>Esseen orfo: «Getesemani» yiste dimta hamete. Yesus nawoni meyanon: «Ta ekesta shiiphona; nitto hanta diifotiwa» yi. <verse eid="MRK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>Estan Phexirosnin, Yaqobnin, Yohannisnin barneen ane zoonsire hami. Akamanon suumet nayo ephi. <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>Nawobaasakitonik dey: «Kaanaas kitunanneen kar'a akamanon suumewa. Hanta faafaat guzira oodtiwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 14:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>Garonon ek sina eksere daasta gandere chimtonir sinfaanane shanani wonaas basaastan aatanamato shiiphe. <verse eid="MRK 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>Ekka dey yi: «Aabba abataaso! Zuuttera neek chimterwa. Han ephphatoonak fa shanaason tayistan woksu. Sinuntano ta sholena bar sinnoynamato ne sholeta bar sinunwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>Wolle yeere kunefeen bi. Phexirosnin dey: «Simonno; kuntaroso? Isa sa'atine guzire oodak aane chimenoso? <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/>Fatanaassi girunoytimato guzira shiiphotiwa. Ayyana hooreratu fa sinuntano ashaas hopiyawa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>Estan wolle dey ukkoti shiiphena shiiphooson shiiphe. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>Wolle dey yeen aaffesiis afay'nik fayna boor'a kunefeen bi. Barik maksefe baronnu aane arsoto.<verse eid="MRK 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>Keezsa dey yeere: «Hashneen kunfetiyoso? Hashneen beysa ephdifetiyoso? Ese haye hooronawa, sa'atiis kar'i; Asuni Naa boor'ni meeni kushusi aattere imtonir. <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/>Kabini hamni; Hash taan aatire imni bar tai'se» yi.<verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Ootto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat. 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luqa. 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoha. 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>Geregere es baron makefena kabaasik asire heppesasin isaas Yuuda sinfe bar ye. Barneen ane sikonewa mukne epho maagni gaanynyanikin, Museni tumaasi assinynyanikin, kur'uni meyakin wostere yeese showo asuni meya feeseter. <verse eid="MRK 14:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Aatire imni Yuuda zeemme: «Ta daamona barintu nitto makira ephpha hamtiwa» yire besok makere feer.<verse eid="MRK 14:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Geregere yeere Yesusniki tai'sere: «Assinynyano!» yit daame. <verse eid="MRK 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>Es ane yeese baasso dey Yesusnin ephete. <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Esta yere baassossin isaas siifo zanbaassin kisire maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaasa wostinynyani odonon kace. <verse eid="MRK 14:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Yesus dey: «Bo'inynyanin ephnirimato sikonewa mukne ephpha taan ephatik yaatiyoso? <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/>Betemeqdesiissi wonna wonna nittoneen ane faafaat assifana kabaasik aane taan epheti. Sinuntano tichche bar ko'unak han bar siniwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 14:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>Nawoni meya dey zuuttambesiise barin beyfaat eelesete.<verse eid="MRK 14:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Atubaasta wor'a maama mayo isa na'o asu basa orfoose hamet feer. <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>Asuni meya barin ephefe kabaasik maamaason ha'aat atatubaase eeli.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Shonggosta Ta'i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mat. 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luqa. 22:54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoha. 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>Yesusnin maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaaski ephere hamete. Museni tumaasi assinynya, kur'uni meenawa maagni gaanynye meena zuuttere kuphisete. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>Phexiros maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaasa ojni keerkalo kar'ananneen woksok orfobaase hami. Estak dey wostinynyani meyaneen diifaat geya besit feer. <verse eid="MRK 14:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>Maagni meeni gaanynyaasnawa shoongoose zuuttesere Yesusnin woruk zaalnin sholsere aane danoto. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Showobesiis esha zaala makset feeseter. Sinuntano maksefe zaalaas isarba foonto sini.<verse eid="MRK 14:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57-58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57-58"/>Isa isa asuni meya kabsere: « ‹Ta han kushuk keete Betemeqdesiison bogaat keezsinari wono ooma kushuk keetonoron keer'ana› yifeen odeniwa» yit esha zaala maksete. <verse eid="MRK 14:57-58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>Sinuntano hashnu zaalni meeni kaamaas aane isar sina.<verse eid="MRK 14:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>Maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaas baasso ganeyaassin kabire Yesusnin: «Han baasso neyista maksefe zaalaas aambanso? Isaronnu wolgu beytaroso?» yi. <verse eid="MRK 14:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>Sinuntano bar shaakki. Isaronnu aane wolguwe. Hepsinu Maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaas: «Suusto Ha'oosi naa Kiristoos nenoso?» yit mamsi.<verse eid="MRK 14:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>Yesus wolgire: «Tawa; Asuni Naa Ha'oosi o'itta diifeennawa samaki shaaruusta yeefeenna biyatiwa» yi. <verse eid="MRK 14:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>Maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaas maybaason karasaat: «Hanneen ekalo ooma zaala awuniron sholsunirinso? <verse eid="MRK 14:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/>Ha'ooson me'baason odetiwa. Nittok awu sinna bestefaso?» yi. Baasso zuuttesere: «Kitu barik sholsuwa» yit mangsu kar'esete.<verse eid="MRK 14:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Isa isaas basaasta tujo ephete. Aaffaason maamak ukaat ki'et: «Raaji innok makowa» yisete. Wostinynyani meya dey bochet ephphe hamete.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiros Yesusnin Morme</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat. 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luqa. 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoha. 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>Phexiros haat ojni keerkalo feen isa Maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaasa keeri wostinynya ya. <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>Phexiros geya besifeen gasasira biyaat: «Ne dey Naaziretki Yesusneen ane faatarwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 14:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Sinuntano bar wolgire: «Ne makefata baron ta aane arutwe. Aane gasasut» yit morme. Gerakalo finynya kesfena kabaasik ako oori.<verse eid="MRK 14:68"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>Keerki wostinynyaas hepsa dey biira esta yere baassok: «Haniis baasso keengwa» yit make. <verse eid="MRK 14:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>Bar dey hepsa: «Morme» Garonon feere esta yere asuni meya Phexirosnin: «Futok ne Galiilaki asu sinta boor'a baasso keengwa» yisete.<verse eid="MRK 14:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>Sinuntano bar: «Han maksefeti asusin aane arifatwa!» yit barin bar wolgire erwit teyi.<verse eid="MRK 14:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>Geregere dey ako hepsa oori. Phexirosnin Yesus: «Ako hepsa wolle oorunoyfeen ne keeza wolla mormotawa» yina kaamaas nibbaasta kejfaan seektere waasi.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Philaxosni Sina Ta'i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat. 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luqa. 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoha. 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>E'so wonsak maagni gaanynyani meya kur'uni meyaneen, Museni tumaasi assinynyanawa shonggoni meena zuuttere isarik merkesete. Esseen orfo Yesusnin taar'e taamme Philaxosnik aatire imete. <verse eid="MRK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>Pilatos dey: «Ne Ayhudni meeni taatonoso?» yire mamsi. Yesus dey: «Aa, ne maketaasimatowa» yire wolgi.<verse eid="MRK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>Maagni meeni gaanynyani meya Yesusnin showo chowak malasset feeseter. <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>Pilatos dey: «Isaronne aane wolgifenoso? Apun chowanso neyista malassediferi» yire mamsi.<verse eid="MRK 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>Yesus isa wuzane aane wolguwe sinna boor'a Pilatos diinqe.<verse eid="MRK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusniista Kituni Kangsuni Kar'a Kate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat. 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luqa. 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-40">Yoha. 18:39-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:1-16">19:1-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>Pilatos faasikani heebo heeboosik asuni meya mamussete isa taatonin kotte gafkit feer. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>Manguk taatoosata kabsere kaani woruk taatere fe asuni meyaassin isa Barbaan yiste asu feer. <verse eid="MRK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Darani meya yeesere: «Hazozoti zagifataasimato isa taatonin innok kotwa» yit mamussete. <verse eid="MRK 15:8"/><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9-10"/>Pilatos wolgire maagni gaanynyani meya koonak aatire imetemato arina boor'a: «Ayhudni meeni taatosin kotanak sholefetiyoso?» yi.<verse eid="MRK 15:9-10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>Sinuntano maagni gaanynyani meya Yesusnin beyfaat Barbaanin kotanak Pilatoosnin mamussonek daraasin kabugsesete. <verse eid="MRK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>Pilatos hepsa wolgire: «Eekin Ayhudni meeni taatowa yifeti barin awu zagunak sholefetiso?» yi.<verse eid="MRK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>Darani meya dey: «Suuttowowa!» yit chaagete.<verse eid="MRK 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>Pilatos dey: «Aamso? Zagina mangsu aambanso?» yi. Sinuntano baasso: «Suuttowowa!» yit chaaga aatamsisete.<verse eid="MRK 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>Pilatos daraasa safaranon zaguk sholefaat Barbaanin baassok kotaat Yesusnin alanggak ichchonak zagire suuttonak aatire imi.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Taar'oni Meya Yesusnin Kanyesete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat. 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoha. 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Taar'osakito: «Pratoriyon» yistefa daa ha'sife basa ojni keerkalo Yesusnin ephphe hamete. Estan oom taar'oni meyanon isarik zuutisete. <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>She'a maya maysisete; dey seer'a ma'ire zawudi zagire teetbaasta guufsisete. <verse eid="MRK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>Estan: «Ayhudni taatono! Naga neek sinfawungwa!» yit naga ooshsheset feeseter. <verse eid="MRK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>Teetbaason sobboqok ichet, tujet barik kaa'net moosesete. <verse eid="MRK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>Kanyesetenneen orfo she'a mayaason gaay'aat basa mayaason mayissere suuttonak ephphe hamesete.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Suutto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat. 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luqa. 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoha. 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>Isa ugunni wof Aleksandirosnawa Rufosna asi aba sina Simon yiste qerenaki asu beeden yeefeen danere mesqeliison wor'anak giddisisete. <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>Estan Yesusnin ephphe Golgota yistera teegtefa dimaasta taamete. Es Golgota uus dey: «Teetni megani dima» uu. <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>Estak dey kumbineen woi'to wayinini usha ushanak imesete. Sinuntano bar aane ushe. <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/>Estan suutesete; maybaasta dey ixa ha'sere aa'esete. <verse eid="MRK 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>Es suutesefe kabaasik e'so keez sa'ati. <verse eid="MRK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>Malataasi ticha: «Ayhudni taato» yifar. <verse eid="MRK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>Hep bo'inynyanin teshshesete Yesusneen ane isaasin oi'ta teshbaasta isaasin dey halda teshbaasta suutesete. <verse eid="MRK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28"/>Matsafaas: «Manguni meyaneen faadtewa» yina bar ko'i.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Manguni meyaneen faadtewa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa isa zeemoti Girikni tichaassi aafa.</char></note> <figure style="fig" alt="Myrrh bush, man tapping myrrh, jars, bowl" file="BK00119B.tif" size="span" ref="15:24">Kumbini i'o</figure><verse eid="MRK 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>Teshba aatfe ugunni wofni meya teetbesiison shorkit ekka yit me'et feeseter: «Yi, ‹Betemeqdesiison<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:29 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Betemeqdesiis: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">betemeqdesiis uus sirki kiddiste kiddusaniis</char></note> bogaat keezsinari wono keer'anarwa› yi neno! <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>Ese hash mesqelistan kerera teetneeson fu'owa!»<verse eid="MRK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>Esiisimato maagni gaanynyani meenawa Museni tumaasi assinynyaasna baassotna baassotna: «Oomiisin fu'e, sinuntano teetbaason fu'ok aane chime! <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>Ese biira barik amanonik bar muudto Israelni taatoos hash mesqelistan kerowowa» yiset kanyesete. Barneen ane suutte bo'inynyani meya dey barin me'et feeseter.<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Kitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat. 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luqa. 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoha. 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>Tooni issun sa'atiistan kabira izgin sa'ati kar'ana kabaneen daas zuuttera talma sini. <verse eid="MRK 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/>Izgin sa'atiista Yesus: «Elohe, elohe, lamasebeqtani» yire akama kaamak chaagi. Kotbaas dey: «Ha'onaase! Ha'onaase! Awuni boor'a taan beyitse?» uu.<verse eid="MRK 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Esta yere asuni meyaassin isa isaas odesere: «Odotiwa; Eliyasnintu teegedifewa» yisete. <verse eid="MRK 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/>Isar eelle aka ephak chima wuzaassi haphqire sobboqota duusire suutire ushanak Yesusnik imaat: «Beytiwa shakaani Eeliyas yeere kessunitto biyaniwa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>Yesus akama kaamak chaagi; Kaabaas dey kesi.<verse eid="MRK 15:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>Betemeqdesiisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">15:29 biiti</char></note> yinu denun daa heppik karate. <verse eid="MRK 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>Yesusni sinaasta yere tii meeni gaanynyaas kaabaas kesbaason biyaat: «Han asus futok Ha'oni naawa» yi.<verse eid="MRK 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>Isa isa mashka meya dey woksok biyet feeseter. Es baassossin Megdelawitki Maarami, Salome, hate Yaqobnawa Yoosana asi into Maaramine feeseter. <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/>Baasso Yesus Galiilak feena kabaasik Yesusneen ane hamefaafa argasit faaser. Esiisimato Yesusneen ane Yerusalem hama ooma showo mashkasu faaser.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Kabbarto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat. 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luqa. 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoha. 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42-43"/>Gerok waalfana kabaasik Armatiyaski Yosef yiste asu ye. Yosef shoonggo keysefe baassossin isaas dey ulfinto asu. Bar dey Ha'oosi taatonon abdik oodet feer. Wonaas beysani wonaastan zeemma fa hoossuni wona sinna boor'a digonoy Pilatosniki girire Yesusni dugnooson imanak mamsi. <verse eid="MRK 15:42-43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>Pilatos dey: «Aakkak tai'ni kitiso?» yit diinqe. Tii taar'oni meeni gaanynyaasin teegsire: «Futok Yesus kitiyoso?» yit mamsi. <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>Tii taar'oni meeni gaanynyaaskin odenanneen orfo Yosefnik Yesusni dugnooson imi. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Yosef dey kinoni maama waagere mesqelistan dugnooson kessire kimme katera hoore shu'ni moogsi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:46 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Katera hoore mooga: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayhudni meeni tumak mooga shu'atu katera hoorefar</char></note> kabbare. Estan inya shu'a bukalsire moogaasi noononon uki. <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Megdelawitki Maaraminewa Yosani into Maaramine Yesusni dugnooson ay kabbarsetemato biyedifar.<verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Kitun Kabu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luqa. 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoha. 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Beysani wona aatnanneen orfo Megdelawitki Maarami, Salome, Yaqobni into Maaramine yeesere Yesusni dugnooson woshshuk sawa wuzakin hoore shitto waagsete. <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>Torbaniisi tesuni wono e'so awa kesfana kabaasik moogaaski hamete. <verse eid="MRK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3"/>Baassotna baassotna: «Shu'aason moogaasi noonotan innok bukalsunir oonso?» yiset faaser. <verse eid="MRK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4"/>Es baron dey yisetees shu'aas akama inya sinna boor'a. Sinuntano kaanne biyeten shu'aas bukalera shaatenamato biyete. <verse eid="MRK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>Moogaassi girseten foro maya mayo na'o asu oi'ta wolusta diifen biire naysete.<verse eid="MRK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>Es na'o asus: «Nayotiita! Suutte Naaziretki Yesusnintu sholedifetimato arifawungwe. Bar kabi; hantak aafe; barin kunussete dimaason biyoti. <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/>Ese hamfaat nawoni meyaknawa phexirosna: ‹Nittok makenaasimato nittoostan zeemme Galiila hamnir. Estak biyati› yira maksoti» yi.<verse eid="MRK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>Es mashkasusikito digak korkiset moogaassin kessa eelese. Akamanon digsena boor'a isa wuzane ooknu aane maksowa.<verse eid="MRK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Nawoni Meyak Uphe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat. 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yoha. 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>[Yesus Torbaniisi tesuni wono e'so kitun kabinanneen orfo zeemme naafun kiina ayyana barissin kisina Megdelawitki Maaramik beste. <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/>Bar dey hamma suumetnawa waasitna feese basa zoonsini meyak es baron make. <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/>Baasso dey hayew sinbaasewa barik bestobaase odesefe kabaasik aane amantosoto. <verse eid="MRK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>Esseen orfo baassossin hep nawobaasakito beede hamefeen Yesus uguntak ooma gitok beste. <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/>Baasso dey wolle hamme oom nawoni meyak maksete. Es baasso dey aane amanosoto. <verse eid="MRK 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>Esseen orfo dey asire issees muu meesefeen Yesus baassok bestere: «Yesus kitun kabire kaak fe; inno dey aafniisik biini» yisere makse baassotin amano beyobesiisiknawa nibbesiisi chimakna baassotin ke'i. <verse eid="MRK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/>Tusire dey ekka yi: «Daasi birato zuuttambaase asiista hamti. Misirachchuni kaamaason asu zuuttambaase asik makoti. <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/>Amanere haphukte bar faruna. Sinuntano amanonoy basaasta mangsu kater. <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/>Amane baasso han besoson zagsone; ta sunaasik kiina ayyanaason kisusone; gaddo noonok wolumsone. <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/>Zawaasikitonon ephone; woruni wuzanu ushefaatene baassotin isanne aafa miir'ona wuza. Kushubesiison mettanni meenista ta'usone baasso dey farsone.»<verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Den Sama Hami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luqa. 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Wos. 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>Daam Yesus es baron nawoni meyak makenanneen orfo den sama hami. Ha'oosi hoi'ta teshta di. <verse eid="MRK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>Baasso dey kesere daa daa zuuttambaase asiissi hamefaafe maksete. Daamiis dey baassoneen ane wostet feer. Biistera artonoy wuzani zaguk maksefe misirachchuni kaamaas futo sinbaason besit feer.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akamanon amanto zeemoti Girikni tichaasewa ooma ooma tichaase 9-20 fa baron aane daysifa.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
